1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,870
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Kuna mandhari manne.

2
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:10,370
Sehemu ya 1: Uzoefu wa Utamaduni wa Kijapani Unaopendwa na Wageni / Matukio ya Kijapani Maarufu kwa Wageni

3
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:13,570
Umeangalia habari za asubuhi?

4
00:00:13,592 --> 00:00:16,159
Hapana, sijawaona.

5
00:00:16,182 --> 00:00:18,463
Habari gani?

6
00:00:18,487 --> 00:00:24,454
Watalii wanapenda sana ziara za uzoefu wa utamaduni wa Kijapani.

7
00:00:24,477 --> 00:00:26,930
Ziara za uzoefu wa utamaduni?

8
00:00:26,953 --> 00:00:29,961
Ni aina gani za uzoefu zinazopendwa?

9
00:00:29,984 --> 00:00:34,864
Uzoefu wa kutengeneza sushi na kuvaa kimono ndizo zinazopendwa sana.

10
00:00:34,887 --> 00:00:36,821
Inaonekana kuwa ya furaha!

11
00:00:36,844 --> 00:00:40,298
Wapi unaweza kufanya uzoefu huu?

12
00:00:40,321 --> 00:00:44,380
Unaweza kufanya uzoefu huko Asakusa na Kyoto.

13
00:00:44,404 --> 00:00:48,537
Je, unaweza kusikiliza maelekezo kwa Kiingereza?

14
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,643
Ndiyo.

15
00:00:49,667 --> 00:00:53,500
Kuna mwongozo anayeongea Kiingereza atakayekufundisha.

16
00:00:53,523 --> 00:00:57,523
Hivyo basi, huna haja ya wasiwasi kuhusu lugha.

17
00:00:57,546 --> 00:01:01,482
Utakula sushi uliyoifanya mwenyewe pale pale.

18
00:01:01,505 --> 00:01:05,712
Sushi uliyoifanya mwenyewe ni tamu sana!

19
00:01:05,736 --> 00:01:09,669
Kuna pia madarasa ya kutengeneza wagashi (tamu za Kijapani) na chanoyu (chai ya Kijapani).

20
00:01:09,692 --> 00:01:13,459
Uzoefu wa kutengeneza wagashi unaonekana kuwa wa kipekee pia!

21
00:01:13,482 --> 00:01:16,728
Unaweza kula pamoja na matcha (chai ya kijani).

22
00:01:16,751 --> 00:01:20,328
Unaweza kupiga picha nyingi!

23
00:01:20,351 --> 00:01:21,845
Ndiyo.

24
00:01:21,868 --> 00:01:25,606
Ni kumbukumbu nzuri, kwa hiyo inapendwa sana.

25
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:28,709
Ninahifadhi kwa njia gani?

26
00:01:28,732 --> 00:01:32,407
Unaweza kuhifadhi kwa njia ya mtandao.

27
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:35,681
Je, naweza kuhifadhi siku hiyo hiyo?

28
00:01:35,705 --> 00:01:40,772
Ni maarufu sana, kwa hiyo tafadhali hifadhi siku tatu kabla.

29
00:01:40,795 --> 00:01:43,361
Bei ni kiasi gani?

30
00:01:43,384 --> 00:01:48,118
Kwa kila mtu ni kati ya yen 4,000 hadi 6,000.

31
00:01:48,141 --> 00:01:51,374
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

32
00:01:51,397 --> 00:01:53,000
Ndiyo.

33
00:01:53,023 --> 00:01:56,292
Unaweza kulipa mtandaoni kabla ya siku.

34
00:01:56,315 --> 00:01:59,999
Kama nina mzio, je ni salama?

35
00:02:00,023 --> 00:02:04,995
Unaweza kuchagua wakati wa kuhifadhi, kwa hiyo usijali.

36
00:02:05,019 --> 00:02:07,893
Ningependa kushiriki pamoja na familia yangu.

37
00:02:07,917 --> 00:02:12,150
Watoto na watu wazima wote wanaweza kufurahia.

38
00:02:12,173 --> 00:02:16,106
Je, kuna uzoefu wa kupaka rangi kwenye zungu za kazi za jadi?

39
00:02:16,129 --> 00:02:17,663
Ndiyo.

40
00:02:17,686 --> 00:02:21,619
Kuna uzoefu wa kupaka rangi kwenye zungu za kioo.

41
00:02:21,642 --> 00:02:25,381
Itakuwa zawadi nzuri kwa ajili yangu mwenyewe!

42
00:02:25,404 --> 00:02:29,338
Ni kazi ya asili ambayo ni ya pekee duniani.

43
00:02:29,361 --> 00:02:32,930
Nitajiunga na uzoefu huu katika ratiba ya mwishoni mwa wiki hii.

44
00:02:32,954 --> 00:02:38,087
Unaweza kupata brosha katika ofisi ya utalii.

45
00:02:38,110 --> 00:02:41,110
Nitakwenda ofisi ya ushauri kwenye stesheni.

46
00:02:41,133 --> 00:02:44,899
Kuna pia QR code ya tovuti katika ofisi ya ushauri.

47
00:02:44,922 --> 00:02:47,856
Nitaisoma kwa simu yangu na kuhifadhi.

48
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:51,937
Furahia uzoefu wa utamaduni wa Kijapani kwa wingi!

49
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:55,493
Asante kwa maelezo ya kina.

50
00:02:55,516 --> 00:02:58,350
Natumai utakuwa na safari nzuri!

51
00:02:58,373 --> 00:02:59,828
Ndiyo.

52
00:02:59,851 --> 00:03:02,385
Nitakufurahia uzoefu wa utamaduni.

53
00:03:02,408 --> 00:03:11,417
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kupakua.

54
00:03:11,417 --> 00:03:12,917
Sehemu ya 2: Kuhifadhi Uzoefu wa Kutengeneza Sushi / Kuhifadhi Uzoefu wa Kutengeneza Sushi

55
00:03:12,917 --> 00:03:14,983
Samahani.

56
00:03:15,006 --> 00:03:19,464
Ningependa kuhifadhi nafasi kwa ajili ya mafunzo ya kutengeneza sushi.

57
00:03:19,488 --> 00:03:21,521
Karibu sana.

58
00:03:21,544 --> 00:03:25,783
Karibuni katika darasa la kutengeneza sushi.

59
00:03:25,807 --> 00:03:29,857
Je, kuna nafasi katika darasa la kesho?

60
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:31,447
Ndiyo.

61
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:35,514
Kuna nafasi katika darasa la asubuhi kesho.

62
00:03:35,537 --> 00:03:38,604
Darasa huanza saa ngapi?

63
00:03:38,628 --> 00:03:42,161
Darasa huanza saa nne asubuhi (saa kumi na moja jioni kwa wakati wa Japani).

64
00:03:42,184 --> 00:03:46,517
Darasa huchukua muda gani?

65
00:03:46,540 --> 00:03:51,075
Ni mafunzo ya saa moja na nusu.

66
00:03:51,099 --> 00:03:54,233
Tungewahi kushiriki watu wawili.

67
00:03:54,256 --> 00:03:56,622
Watu wawili, sawa.

68
00:03:56,645 --> 00:03:59,379
Tunaweza kukubali nafasi yenu.

69
00:03:59,402 --> 00:04:02,852
Je, kuna mwalimu anayeongozwa kwa Kiingereza?

70
00:04:02,875 --> 00:04:04,441
Ndiyo.

71
00:04:04,464 --> 00:04:08,523
Kuna mfanyakazi anayezungumza Kiingereza atakayekusaidia katika mafunzo.

72
00:04:08,547 --> 00:04:12,627
Tutaunda aina gani za sushi?

73
00:04:12,650 --> 00:04:17,484
Mtaweza kutengeneza nigiri sushi na maki sushi.

74
00:04:17,507 --> 00:04:20,956
Tutaunda sushi ngapi?

75
00:04:20,979 --> 00:04:26,946
Mtafanya nigiri sushi nane na maki sushi moja.

76
00:04:26,969 --> 00:04:30,335
Mtafanya nyingi sana!

77
00:04:30,358 --> 00:04:32,358
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

78
00:04:32,381 --> 00:04:37,228
Mtaweza kula sushi ambayo mmetengeneza wenyewe pale hapo.

79
00:04:37,252 --> 00:04:41,618
Rafiki yangu ana allergy ya uduvi.

80
00:04:41,641 --> 00:04:43,616
Nimeelewa.

81
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:48,073
Tunaweza kubadilisha uduvi na aina nyingine ya samaki.

82
00:04:48,096 --> 00:04:52,429
Je, tunaweza kubadilisha na salmoni au tuna?

83
00:04:52,452 --> 00:04:53,985
Ndiyo.

84
00:04:54,008 --> 00:04:58,042
Tutabadilisha na salmoni au mayai.

85
00:04:58,065 --> 00:05:01,431
Asante kwa uvumilivu wenu.

86
00:05:01,454 --> 00:05:05,221
Karibu kushiriki bila wasiwasi.

87
00:05:05,244 --> 00:05:08,777
Je, tunahitaji kuchukua chochote?

88
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:13,835
Tutakupatia aproni na kofia bure.

89
00:05:13,859 --> 00:05:17,026
Hivyo tunaweza kuja mikono mitupu!

90
00:05:17,049 --> 00:05:18,649
Nafurahi sana!

91
00:05:18,672 --> 00:05:22,672
Tafadhali njooni na mikono safi.

92
00:05:22,695 --> 00:05:25,266
Bei ni kiasi gani?

93
00:05:25,289 --> 00:05:29,558
Bei ni yenye nne elfu na mia tano (¥4500) kwa mtu mmoja.

94
00:05:29,581 --> 00:05:32,630
Kwa watu wawili, ni elfu tisa (¥9000), sawa?

95
00:05:32,653 --> 00:05:34,253
Ndiyo.

96
00:05:34,276 --> 00:05:36,749
Ndio, ni yenye elfu tisa (¥9000).

97
00:05:36,772 --> 00:05:42,017
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

98
00:05:42,041 --> 00:05:43,607
Ndiyo.

99
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:48,364
Unaweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo au kadi ya kunywea.

100
00:05:48,387 --> 00:05:51,477
Nitakulipa sasa hapa.

101
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:53,833
Nitatoa kadi yangu.

102
00:05:53,856 --> 00:05:57,689
Tafadhali pigia kadi yako kwenye kifaa hiki.

103
00:05:57,712 --> 00:06:00,846
Imepiga sauti 'beep'.

104
00:06:00,869 --> 00:06:03,602
Malipo yamekamilika.

105
00:06:03,625 --> 00:06:06,636
Tutakupatia tiketi ya uhifadhi.

106
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:11,638
Tutakuja saa tatu na robo asubuhi kesho (saa nne kasoro robo jioni kwa wakati wa Japani).

107
00:06:11,661 --> 00:06:13,157
Ndiyo.

108
00:06:13,181 --> 00:06:17,233
Tafadhali fika dakika kumi na tano kabla ya saa nne asubuhi katika darasa la Asakusa.

109
00:06:17,256 --> 00:06:20,937
Je, mahali ni karibu na Kaminarimon?

110
00:06:20,961 --> 00:06:25,161
Ni dakika tatu tu kutoka Kaminarimon kwa miguu.

111
00:06:25,184 --> 00:06:27,801
Ni mahali rahisi kupata!

112
00:06:27,825 --> 00:06:30,658
Ninasubiri kesho kwa furaha.

113
00:06:30,681 --> 00:06:32,135
Ndiyo.

114
00:06:32,158 --> 00:06:34,657
Tutakukaribisha kesho.

115
00:06:34,681 --> 00:06:41,786
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye sehemu ya maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti hii inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

116
00:06:41,786 --> 00:06:43,286
Sehemu ya 3: Misingi ya Kukodisha Kimono

117
00:06:43,286 --> 00:06:45,125
Samahani.

118
00:06:45,148 --> 00:06:47,841
Ningependa kukodisha kimono.

119
00:06:47,864 --> 00:06:49,506
Karibu sana.

120
00:06:49,530 --> 00:06:52,863
Karibu kwa duka letu la kukodisha kimono.

121
00:06:52,886 --> 00:06:55,919
Naweza kuivaa sasa hivi?

122
00:06:55,942 --> 00:06:57,410
Ndiyo,

123
00:06:57,434 --> 00:07:00,600
Hata bila ahadi, hakuna matatizo.

124
00:07:00,623 --> 00:07:03,300
Kuna mipango gani?

125
00:07:03,324 --> 00:07:07,740
Tuna mipango ya Kawaida na Premium.

126
00:07:07,764 --> 00:07:10,142
Tofauti yake ni nini?

127
00:07:10,165 --> 00:07:15,931
Mpango wa Premium una kimono nyingi za kuchagua.

128
00:07:15,954 --> 00:07:18,521
Nitachagua mpango wa Premium.

129
00:07:18,544 --> 00:07:20,477
Vema, nimekuelewa.

130
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:24,667
Tafadhali chagua kimono kutoka kwenye rafu hii.

131
00:07:24,690 --> 00:07:27,823
Kuna mitindo mingi ya kuvutia!

132
00:07:27,846 --> 00:07:29,688
Ni ipi inayokupendeza?

133
00:07:29,712 --> 00:07:36,324
Kwa vile ni majira ya joto, tunapendekeza kimono ya majira ya joto au yukata yenye kitambaa cha baridi.

134
00:07:36,347 --> 00:07:40,514
Nitachagua kimono hii ya pinki yenye maua ya m Sakura.

135
00:07:40,537 --> 00:07:43,382
Kimono hii ni nzuri sana!

136
00:07:43,405 --> 00:07:45,840
Itakufaa sana.

137
00:07:45,863 --> 00:07:48,797
Naweza kuchagua obi pia?

138
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:50,157
Ndiyo,

139
00:07:50,181 --> 00:07:55,015
Tafadhali chagua rangi unayopenda kutoka kwenye obi hizi.

140
00:07:55,037 --> 00:07:57,248
Nitachagua obi ya manjano.

141
00:07:57,272 --> 00:08:00,806
Tutakuelekeza chumba cha kuvaa kimono.

142
00:08:00,829 --> 00:08:04,122
Kuvaa kimono kunachukua dakika ngapi?

143
00:08:04,145 --> 00:08:08,594
Kuvaa kimono kunachukua takriban dakika ishirini.

144
00:08:08,617 --> 00:08:12,422
Naweza kupata muonekano wa nywele pia?

145
00:08:12,446 --> 00:08:13,818
Ndiyo,

146
00:08:13,842 --> 00:08:17,975
Kwa nyongeza ya shilingi 1500, tunaweza kukupatia muonekano wa nywele.

147
00:08:17,998 --> 00:08:20,465
Nitapata muonekano wa nywele pia.

148
00:08:20,488 --> 00:08:24,321
Unaweza kuchagua vipodozi vya nywele bure pia.

149
00:08:24,344 --> 00:08:27,378
Nitachagua kipodozi cha ua jekundu.

150
00:08:27,401 --> 00:08:29,379
Ni tamu sana!

151
00:08:29,402 --> 00:08:32,569
Kuvaa kimono na muonekano wa nywele vimekwisha.

152
00:08:32,592 --> 00:08:36,125
Eeh, nimeshikwa na uzuri!

153
00:08:36,148 --> 00:08:38,182
Nafurahi sana!

154
00:08:38,205 --> 00:08:42,282
Tafadhali angalia jinsi inavyoonekana kwenye kioo kikubwa.

155
00:08:42,305 --> 00:08:46,972
Naweza kuweka nguo zangu na mzigo mkubwa hapa?

156
00:08:46,995 --> 00:08:48,266
Ndiyo,

157
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:52,898
Tunaweza kukushikilia kwenye mfuko mkubwa huu.

158
00:08:52,922 --> 00:08:56,021
Nitabeba vitu vyangu vyenye thamani tu.

159
00:08:56,045 --> 00:08:59,703
Tafadhali chagua mkoba na geta.

160
00:08:59,726 --> 00:09:03,361
Nitachagua mkoba mweusi na geta nyekundu.

161
00:09:03,385 --> 00:09:06,352
Umejiandaa kutoka sasa!

162
00:09:06,375 --> 00:09:10,592
Ni saa ngapi ninapaswa kurudi dukani?

163
00:09:10,615 --> 00:09:14,903
Tafadhali rudi dukani kabla ya saa tano na nusu jioni.

164
00:09:14,926 --> 00:09:17,213
Saa tano na nusu jioni.

165
00:09:17,237 --> 00:09:19,005
Nimeelewa.

166
00:09:19,028 --> 00:09:23,482
Ikiwa utachelewa kurudi, utalipa ada ya ziada.

167
00:09:23,506 --> 00:09:26,153
Nitarudi kwa wakati.

168
00:09:26,176 --> 00:09:30,260
Jumla ya malipo ni shilingi 6500.

169
00:09:30,284 --> 00:09:33,151
Naweza kulipa kwa PayPay?

170
00:09:33,174 --> 00:09:34,708
Ndiyo,

171
00:09:34,731 --> 00:09:37,697
Tafadhali scani kodi ya QR.

172
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,574
Nimemaliza malipo.

173
00:09:39,598 --> 00:09:43,365
Furahia kutembea karibu na Kiyomizu-dera.

174
00:09:43,388 --> 00:09:46,258
Nitapiga picha nyingi.

175
00:09:46,281 --> 00:09:48,161
Nenda salama.

176
00:09:48,185 --> 00:09:49,685
Sehemu ya 4: Uzoefu wa Kutengeneza Wagashi ya Kijapani / Japanese Wagashi Making Experience

177
00:09:49,685 --> 00:09:51,818
Samahani.

178
00:09:51,841 --> 00:09:55,408
Je, ni hapa mahali pa kupokea wale wanaofanya uzoefu wa kutengeneza wagashi?

179
00:09:55,431 --> 00:09:58,450
Ndiyo, hapa ndipo.

180
00:09:58,474 --> 00:10:01,007
Karibu sana.

181
00:10:01,030 --> 00:10:05,208
Nimefanya booking kwa saa tano asubuhi, mimi ni Maria.

182
00:10:05,231 --> 00:10:07,365
Maria, ndiyo?

183
00:10:07,388 --> 00:10:09,924
Tumekulinda.

184
00:10:09,947 --> 00:10:13,714
Leo tutatengeneza aina gani ya wagashi?

185
00:10:13,737 --> 00:10:18,070
Tutafanya nerikiri mbili za msimu.

186
00:10:18,093 --> 00:10:20,832
Nerikiri ni nini?

187
00:10:20,855 --> 00:10:25,222
Ni wagashi nzuri inayotengenezwa kwa anko.

188
00:10:25,245 --> 00:10:29,421
Je, naweza kutengeneza umbo kwa mikono yangu?

189
00:10:29,444 --> 00:10:34,503
Ndiyo, tutatumia kiganja cha mkono na mfano wa mbao kutengeneza umbo.

190
00:10:34,527 --> 00:10:39,160
Nimeanza tu, je, nitaweza kufanya vizuri?

191
00:10:39,183 --> 00:10:44,950
Ndiyo, nitakufundisha kwa uangalifu, hakuna matata.

192
00:10:44,973 --> 00:10:49,006
Je, ni lazima navae aproni?

193
00:10:49,029 --> 00:10:54,396
Ndiyo, tafadhali vaa aproni hii na kitambaa cha pembetatu.

194
00:10:54,419 --> 00:10:57,085
Nimevaa aproni.

195
00:10:57,108 --> 00:10:59,442
Nitasaidia mikono.

196
00:10:59,465 --> 00:11:03,738
Tafadhali safisha mikono vizuri kwa sabuni.

197
00:11:03,762 --> 00:11:05,695
Nimesafisha mikono.

198
00:11:05,718 --> 00:11:07,918
Tayari.

199
00:11:07,941 --> 00:11:10,775
Tafadhali keti hapa.

200
00:11:10,798 --> 00:11:12,865
Vifaa vimetayarishwa.

201
00:11:12,888 --> 00:11:16,688
Kuna anko ya rangi nyingi!

202
00:11:16,711 --> 00:11:20,406
Tutaganda anko ya waridi na kijani.

203
00:11:20,430 --> 00:11:23,563
Je, nitaweza kuzifanya ziwe mviringo?

204
00:11:23,586 --> 00:11:27,419
Tafadhali zifanye mviringo kwa kutumia kiganja chako kwa upole.

205
00:11:27,442 --> 00:11:30,209
Zimekuwa mviringo vizuri!

206
00:11:30,232 --> 00:11:35,503
Sasa tutatumia kijiti cha pembetatu cha mbao kuchora mistari ya petali.

207
00:11:35,527 --> 00:11:38,422
Kutia mistari, ndiyo?

208
00:11:38,446 --> 00:11:40,379
Tutachora mistari.

209
00:11:40,402 --> 00:11:42,402
Ni nzuri sana!

210
00:11:42,425 --> 00:11:45,564
Ua la asagao limekwisha.

211
00:11:45,587 --> 00:11:50,231
Waa, inaonekana kama ua la kweli, ni nzuri sana!

212
00:11:50,254 --> 00:11:54,067
Ya pili tutafanya ua la chrysanthemum.

213
00:11:54,090 --> 00:11:58,324
Nimefanikiwa kutengeneza umbo la pili vizuri.

214
00:11:58,347 --> 00:12:02,980
Sasa tutatumia chasen kutengeneza matcha.

215
00:12:03,003 --> 00:12:06,003
Tutakoroga hadi kutokea povu.

216
00:12:06,026 --> 00:12:10,093
Tumia kiwiko chako kwa kasi.

217
00:12:10,116 --> 00:12:12,735
Povu zimekuwa nzuri!

218
00:12:12,759 --> 00:12:17,559
Tafadhali kula wagashi ulizotengeneza na matcha hii.

219
00:12:17,582 --> 00:12:20,415
Tutakata kwa kutumia kijiti cha kuandikia.

220
00:12:20,438 --> 00:12:22,771
Ni tamu sana!

221
00:12:22,794 --> 00:12:27,131
Matcha yenye uchungu na wagashi tamu zinafaa sana pamoja.

222
00:12:27,155 --> 00:12:31,822
Je, naweza kuchukua wagashi iliyobaki nyumbani?

223
00:12:31,845 --> 00:12:33,281
Ndiyo,

224
00:12:33,304 --> 00:12:38,162
Unaweza kuchukua ndani ya sanduku maalum hili.

225
00:12:38,186 --> 00:12:40,837
Ningependa kuonyesha familia yangu.

226
00:12:40,861 --> 00:12:42,957
Nitaweka ndani ya sanduku.

227
00:12:42,980 --> 00:12:48,213
Ada ni shilingi elfu tatu mia tano kwa ajili ya uzoefu na chai.

228
00:12:48,236 --> 00:12:50,731
Nitakulipa kwa pesa taslimu.

229
00:12:50,754 --> 00:12:53,288
Nitakulipa shilingi elfu nne.

230
00:12:53,311 --> 00:12:55,799
Hii ni pesa zako ya rudisho shilingi mia tano.

231
00:12:55,823 --> 00:12:58,098
Asante sana.

232
00:12:58,122 --> 00:12:59,622
Sehemu ya 5: Uzoefu wa Kupaka Rangi kwenye Kengele ya Edo / Edo Furin Wind Chime Painting Experience

233
00:12:59,622 --> 00:13:01,955
Samahani.

234
00:13:01,978 --> 00:13:05,822
Ningependa kujaribu kupaka rangi kwenye kengele ya upepo.

235
00:13:05,845 --> 00:13:07,934
Karibu sana.

236
00:13:07,958 --> 00:13:12,158
Karibu kwa duka la kengele za upepo za Edo.

237
00:13:12,181 --> 00:13:16,356
Je, naweza kujaribu hata kama sina ufuatiliaji?

238
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:18,113
Ndiyo,

239
00:13:18,136 --> 00:13:23,954
Tunapokea wageni sasa, unaweza kuanza mara moja.

240
00:13:23,977 --> 00:13:28,144
Ungependa kupaka rangi kwenye kengele ya aina gani?

241
00:13:28,168 --> 00:13:33,044
Tutapaka rangi kwenye kengele ya kioo isiyo na rangi.

242
00:13:33,067 --> 00:13:36,634
Je, utapaka rangi ndani au nje?

243
00:13:36,657 --> 00:13:39,257
Utapaka nje au ndani?

244
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:44,951
Tutapaka rangi ndani ya kengele kwa kutumia brashi.

245
00:13:44,974 --> 00:13:49,945
Unapaka ndani? Ni kidogo ngumu, sivyo?

246
00:13:49,969 --> 00:13:55,636
Unahitaji kupaka herufi au picha kinyume ili ziweze kusomwa vizuri.

247
00:13:55,659 --> 00:14:00,592
Kupaka kinyume ni kidogo ngumu.

248
00:14:00,615 --> 00:14:05,220
Tuna mifano rahisi, usijali.

249
00:14:05,244 --> 00:14:08,530
Ni muundo gani unaopendwa zaidi?

250
00:14:08,554 --> 00:14:14,521
Samaki wa dhahabu, mialiko ya moto, na maua ya asubuhi yana umaarufu.

251
00:14:14,544 --> 00:14:17,977
Ningependa kupaka samaki mwekundu.

252
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:21,440
Muundo mzuri unaofaa kwa majira ya joto!

253
00:14:21,464 --> 00:14:24,934
Je, unatumia rangi ya akriliki?

254
00:14:24,957 --> 00:14:26,724
Ndiyo,

255
00:14:26,747 --> 00:14:30,880
Tunatumia rangi ambayo haiondoki kwa maji baada ya kukauka.

256
00:14:30,903 --> 00:14:34,703
Nitapaka polepole kwa kutumia brashi nyembamba.

257
00:14:34,726 --> 00:14:36,526
Ndiyo,

258
00:14:36,549 --> 00:14:40,167
Pumzika kidogo na uanze kupaka.

259
00:14:40,191 --> 00:14:43,724
Nimefanikiwa kuchora umbo la samaki.

260
00:14:43,747 --> 00:14:46,720
Umefanya vizuri sana!

261
00:14:46,744 --> 00:14:50,228
Rangi nyekundu inang'aa sana.

262
00:14:50,251 --> 00:14:53,701
Nitapaka mimea ya majani pia karibu nao.

263
00:14:53,725 --> 00:14:57,895
Kazi yako ni nzuri na yenye usawa.

264
00:14:57,918 --> 00:15:02,552
Je, utandika nini kwenye karatasi chini ya kengele?

265
00:15:02,575 --> 00:15:07,308
Andika matakwa yako au jina lako kwenye karatasi ndogo.

266
00:15:07,331 --> 00:15:12,064
Nitaandika jina langu na afya.

267
00:15:12,087 --> 00:15:15,102
Tumia kalamu ya brashi kuandika.

268
00:15:15,125 --> 00:15:17,159
Nimeandika.

269
00:15:17,182 --> 00:15:19,382
Nitashikisha kwa uzi.

270
00:15:19,405 --> 00:15:24,899
Tutakausha rangi kwa kutumia kiyoyozi.

271
00:15:24,923 --> 00:15:28,523
Wakati upepo unapovuma, hutoa sauti nzuri ya 'chirin'.

272
00:15:28,546 --> 00:15:33,162
Pembe za kioo zina umbo la pembetatu, hivyo hutoa sauti nzuri.

273
00:15:33,185 --> 00:15:36,785
Hii ni sauti ya kitamaduni ya Japani.

274
00:15:36,808 --> 00:15:38,893
Inanipa amani.

275
00:15:38,917 --> 00:15:43,487
Tutaiweka ndani ya sanduku kwa uangalifu.

276
00:15:43,510 --> 00:15:48,289
Je, naweza kufunga kwa plastiki ya bubu ili isivunjike?

277
00:15:48,313 --> 00:15:50,046
Ndiyo,

278
00:15:50,069 --> 00:15:54,117
Tutafunga vizuri kwa plastiki ya bubu na kuweka ndani ya sanduku.

279
00:15:54,141 --> 00:15:58,274
Nitaiweka ndani ya sanduku la safari na kuchukua nyumbani.

280
00:15:58,297 --> 00:16:03,994
Ada ya huduma ni shilingi 2,800 ikiwa ni pamoja na gharama ya kujaribu.

281
00:16:04,018 --> 00:16:07,751
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

282
00:16:07,774 --> 00:16:09,343
Ndiyo,

283
00:16:09,367 --> 00:16:12,655
Unaweza kutumia malipo ya kugusa (touch payment) pia.

284
00:16:12,678 --> 00:16:14,971
Nitakulipa kwa kadi.

285
00:16:14,994 --> 00:16:16,794
Asante sana.

286
00:16:16,817 --> 00:16:22,417
Tafadhali weke kwa makini kengele yako ya pekee duniani.

287
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:23,940
Sehemu ya 6: Sheria mpya na ada za kupanda Mlima Fuji / Sheria Mpya na Ada za Kupanda Mlima Fuji

288
00:16:23,940 --> 00:16:30,107
Ningependa kusikia kuhusu sheria mpya za kupanda Mlima Fuji.

289
00:16:30,130 --> 00:16:35,730
Kwa upande wa Mkoa wa Yamanashi, sheria mpya zimeanza mwaka huu.

290
00:16:35,753 --> 00:16:38,753
Nimesikia kuna ada ya kupita.

291
00:16:38,776 --> 00:16:40,509
Ada ni ngapi?

292
00:16:40,532 --> 00:16:45,365
Kuna ada ya shilingi 2,000 kwa kila mtu.

293
00:16:45,388 --> 00:16:47,761
Shilingi 2,000, sawa.

294
00:16:47,785 --> 00:16:51,318
Je, ni tofauti na pesa za mchango wa uhifadhi?

295
00:16:51,341 --> 00:16:57,308
Ndiyo, ni tofauti na mchango wa hiari wa shilingi 1,000.

296
00:16:57,331 --> 00:17:03,731
Kwa jumla ni shilingi 3,000 kwa kila mtu, ndivyo?

297
00:17:03,754 --> 00:17:06,721
Nitakulipa mahali pale au mtandaoni.

298
00:17:06,744 --> 00:17:10,077
Kwa nini wanachukua ada ya kupita?

299
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:14,700
Ili kuzuia msongamano na kuhakikisha usalama.

300
00:17:14,723 --> 00:17:18,935
Je, kuna kikomo cha idadi ya watu wanaopanda kwa siku?

301
00:17:18,959 --> 00:17:24,559
Ndiyo, kila siku watu 4,000 tu ndio wanaoruhusiwa kupanda.

302
00:17:24,582 --> 00:17:29,600
Watu 4,000? Inabidi nifanye hifadhi mapema.

303
00:17:29,623 --> 00:17:34,790
Unaweza kuhifadhi mtandaoni mapema.

304
00:17:34,813 --> 00:17:38,687
Nitakuonyesha nini kwenye geti la kupanda?

305
00:17:38,710 --> 00:17:43,243
Onyesha nambari ya QR ya hifadhi yako kwa simu.

306
00:17:43,266 --> 00:17:46,400
Je, naweza kupanda usiku?

307
00:17:46,423 --> 00:17:52,989
Hapana, geti hufungwa kutoka saa kumi na moja jioni hadi saa tisa asubuhi.

308
00:17:53,012 --> 00:17:56,379
Hii ni ili kuzuia kupanda kwa haraka usiku, ndivyo?

309
00:17:56,402 --> 00:18:02,260
Ndiyo, kupanda usiku bila kupumzika ni hatari na kimepigwa marufuku.

310
00:18:02,284 --> 00:18:08,725
Je, wale waliohifadhi malazi ya mlima wanakuwaje?

311
00:18:08,748 --> 00:18:12,326
Wale waliohifadhi malazi ya mlima wanaweza kupita usiku pia.

312
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:16,083
Kuhifadhi malazi ya mlima ni muhimu sana, basi.

313
00:18:16,106 --> 00:18:21,376
Kwa upande wa Mkoa wa Shizuoka, pia unahitaji kuhifadhi mapema.

314
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:25,600
Nitakubali sheria ili nipande salama.

315
00:18:25,623 --> 00:18:30,223
Usisahau kuandaa nguo za kupoza na mavazi ya mvua.

316
00:18:30,245 --> 00:18:34,012
Hata wakati wa kiangazi, kilele cha mlima kina baridi kama majira ya baridi?

317
00:18:34,035 --> 00:18:39,848
Ndiyo, halijoto kileleni huwa chini hadi nyuzi tano.

318
00:18:39,872 --> 00:18:43,608
Nitaandaa nguo za joto na viatu vya kupanda mlima.

319
00:18:43,631 --> 00:18:47,165
Usisahau kununua vinywaji na taa.

320
00:18:47,188 --> 00:18:50,032
Kuna sheria ya kuchukua takataka zako nyumbani, ndivyo?

321
00:18:50,056 --> 00:18:54,889
Ndiyo, chukua takataka zako zote nyumbani.

322
00:18:54,912 --> 00:18:59,128
Asante kwa kueleza sheria kwa undani.

323
00:18:59,151 --> 00:19:03,385
Tafadhali angalia tovuti rasmi kwa maelezo zaidi.

324
00:19:03,408 --> 00:19:07,343
Ndiyo, leo nitazungumza na tovuti ya hifadhi.

325
00:19:07,366 --> 00:19:11,533
Natumai kuona mandhari nzuri ikiwa ni siku ya jua.

326
00:19:11,556 --> 00:19:15,822
Ndiyo, nitapiga picha na kukujulisha.

327
00:19:15,845 --> 00:19:19,179
Fanya iwe kumbukumbu nzuri.

328
00:19:19,202 --> 00:19:22,008
Nitapanda kwa kuzingatia usalama.

329
00:19:22,031 --> 00:19:24,698
Safari njema, na uangalie usalama.

330
00:19:24,721 --> 00:19:26,221
Sehemu ya 7: Mwongozo wa Kuhifadhi Kupanda Mlima Fuji Mtandaoni / Mwongozo wa Kuhifadhi Kupanda Mlima Fuji Mtandaoni

331
00:19:26,221 --> 00:19:28,188
Samahani.

332
00:19:28,211 --> 00:19:32,427
Tafadhali nionyeshe jinsi ya kuhifadhi kupanda Mlima Fuji mtandaoni.

333
00:19:32,450 --> 00:19:34,483
Karibu sana.

334
00:19:34,506 --> 00:19:38,873
Unaweza kuhifadhi kwa kutumia kompyuta au simu.

335
00:19:38,896 --> 00:19:42,929
Utembelee tovuti rasmi ipi?

336
00:19:42,952 --> 00:19:47,286
Tafadhali tembelea Tovuti Rasmi ya Mlima Fuji.

337
00:19:47,309 --> 00:19:52,358
Je, naweza kubadilisha lugha ya tovuti kuwa Kiingereza?

338
00:19:52,381 --> 00:19:54,015
Ndiyo,

339
00:19:54,038 --> 00:19:59,887
Unaweza kuchagua Kiingereza au Kichina kwenye sehemu ya kulia juu ya skrini.

340
00:19:59,910 --> 00:20:02,643
Nimebadilisha lugha kuwa Kiingereza.

341
00:20:02,666 --> 00:20:06,399
Kisha, ninapaswa kubonyeza kitufe gani?

342
00:20:06,423 --> 00:20:11,195
Bonyeza kitufe chekundu kilichoandikwa 'Kuhifadhi Kupanda Mlima'.

343
00:20:11,219 --> 00:20:12,788
Nimebonyeza.

344
00:20:12,812 --> 00:20:16,578
Skrini ya kuchagua tarehe ya kupanda imeonekana.

345
00:20:16,601 --> 00:20:20,368
Chagua tarehe unayotaka kupanda.

346
00:20:20,392 --> 00:20:24,638
Nitachagua Jumapili, tarehe 10 Agosti.

347
00:20:24,662 --> 00:20:28,062
Sasa tutachagua njia ya kupanda pia.

348
00:20:28,085 --> 00:20:30,942
Nitachagua Njia ya Yoshida.

349
00:20:30,965 --> 00:20:33,575
Mna watu wangapi?

350
00:20:33,598 --> 00:20:36,034
Wawili.

351
00:20:36,058 --> 00:20:39,197
Tutachagua watu wawili.

352
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:43,186
Je, ada ya njia na ada ya mchango wa uhifadhi zimeonyeshwa?

353
00:20:43,209 --> 00:20:44,809
Ndiyo,

354
00:20:44,832 --> 00:20:50,166
Ada ya njia ni yenye shilingi 2000 na ada ya mchango ni yenye shilingi 1000.

355
00:20:50,189 --> 00:20:55,662
Kwa kila mtu ni shilingi 3000, kwa hiyo kwa watu wawili ni shilingi 6000.

356
00:20:55,686 --> 00:21:00,355
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

357
00:21:00,378 --> 00:21:02,111
Ndiyo,

358
00:21:02,134 --> 00:21:06,874
Unaweza kuingiza maelezo ya kadi yako na kukamilisha malipo.

359
00:21:06,897 --> 00:21:11,131
Nimeingiza nambari ya kadi na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi.

360
00:21:11,153 --> 00:21:14,491
Bonyeza kitufe cha 'Malipo Yamekamilika'.

361
00:21:14,514 --> 00:21:16,048
Nimebonyeza.

362
00:21:16,071 --> 00:21:19,873
Skrini imeonyesha nambari ya QR!

363
00:21:19,896 --> 00:21:24,896
Hifadhi nambari hiyo ya QR kwenye simu yako.

364
00:21:24,919 --> 00:21:28,559
Nitahifadhi kwa kupiga picha ya skrini.

365
00:21:28,583 --> 00:21:33,383
Siku ya kupanda, onesha nambari ya QR kwenye lango la kupanda mlima.

366
00:21:33,406 --> 00:21:37,096
Je, naweza kuonyesha karatasi iliyochapishwa?

367
00:21:37,120 --> 00:21:38,772
Ndiyo,

368
00:21:38,795 --> 00:21:42,374
Unaweza kuchukua karatasi iliyochapishwa pia.

369
00:21:42,398 --> 00:21:45,846
Nitachapisha karatasi pia na kuchukua nayo.

370
00:21:45,869 --> 00:21:48,136
Ni salama hivyo.

371
00:21:48,159 --> 00:21:51,092
Je, umepokea barua pepe ya uthibitisho wa mahifadhi?

372
00:21:51,115 --> 00:21:52,649
Ndiyo,

373
00:21:52,672 --> 00:21:56,638
Nimepokea arifa ya kukamilika kwenye anwani yangu ya barua pepe.

374
00:21:56,661 --> 00:22:01,301
Hivyo, mahifadhi ya kupanda Mlima Fuji yamekamilika.

375
00:22:01,325 --> 00:22:05,258
Utaratibu ulikuwa wa kueleweka na umefanyika kwa urahisi.

376
00:22:05,281 --> 00:22:10,714
Kama hali ya hewa itakuwa mbaya na kupanda kutatizatwa, pesa zitarejeshwa.

377
00:22:10,737 --> 00:22:14,337
Mfumo wa kurudisha pesa ni wa kufaa sana.

378
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:18,960
Usisahau kuandaa tiketi ya basi hadi lango la kupanda mlima.

379
00:22:18,983 --> 00:22:23,383
Nitahifadhi tiketi ya basi ya kasi kutoka Shinjuku mtandaoni pia.

380
00:22:23,406 --> 00:22:25,740
Maandalizi yako ni bora kabisa!

381
00:22:25,763 --> 00:22:28,529
Safari njema na uwahi kurudi salama.

382
00:22:28,552 --> 00:22:30,221
Asante sana.

383
00:22:30,245 --> 00:22:32,211
Nitakijifurahisha.

384
00:22:32,234 --> 00:22:35,470
Uwe na safari nzuri ya kupanda mlima.

385
00:22:35,494 --> 00:22:36,994
Sehemu ya 8: Njia za Kupanda Mlima na Tahadhari

386
00:22:36,994 --> 00:22:38,960
Samahani.

387
00:22:38,983 --> 00:22:42,456
Je, hii ndiyo ofisi ya maelekezo ya Kituo cha Nusu Mlima?

388
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:45,751
Ndiyo, hapa ndipo.

389
00:22:45,775 --> 00:22:47,775
Karibu sana.

390
00:22:47,799 --> 00:22:52,732
Tafadhali niambie kuhusu njia za kupanda hadi kilele.

391
00:22:52,755 --> 00:22:56,921
Nitakupa ramani ya Njia ya Yoshida.

392
00:22:56,944 --> 00:22:59,036
Asante sana.

393
00:22:59,060 --> 00:23:02,993
Inachukua muda gani hadi kufika kilele?

394
00:23:03,016 --> 00:23:10,258
Kupanda huchukua saa sita hivi, na kuteremka huchukua saa tatu na nusu.

395
00:23:10,282 --> 00:23:15,482
Je, kuna kitu chochote cha kuzingatia wakati wa kupanda?

396
00:23:15,505 --> 00:23:22,505
Tafadhali, epuka ugonjwa wa mlimani. Je, nawezaje kuzuia ugonjwa huo?

397
00:23:22,528 --> 00:23:27,607
Pumzika kwa saa moja au zaidi kwenye kituo cha nusu mlima (gogo).

398
00:23:27,630 --> 00:23:31,312
Hivyo mwili wako utazoea na kimo cha juu.

399
00:23:31,336 --> 00:23:33,071
Ndiyo.

400
00:23:33,095 --> 00:23:36,528
Kumbuka kunywa maji mara kwa mara.

401
00:23:36,551 --> 00:23:40,084
Je, kuna vyoo wakati wa kupanda mlima?

402
00:23:40,107 --> 00:23:44,541
Kuna vyoo vinavyolipishwa kwenye kila kibanda cha mlima.

403
00:23:44,565 --> 00:23:48,610
Bei ni kiasi gani kwa mara moja?

404
00:23:48,633 --> 00:23:54,167
Unahitaji kuacha bakshishi ya shilingi 200 hadi 300 kwa kila matumizi.

405
00:23:54,190 --> 00:23:57,756
Nitaandaa sarafu za shilingi 100 na kuzipeleka.

406
00:23:57,779 --> 00:24:01,589
Ni rahisi kama utaweka sarafu ndogo ndogo kwenye pochi yako.

407
00:24:01,613 --> 00:24:05,213
Je, naweza kununua maji njiani?

408
00:24:05,236 --> 00:24:07,036
Ndiyo.

409
00:24:07,059 --> 00:24:12,118
Unaweza kununua maji na vitafunwa kwenye duka la kibanda cha mlima.

410
00:24:12,141 --> 00:24:15,574
Je, bei za vitu ziko ghali juu ya mlima?

411
00:24:15,598 --> 00:24:20,417
Chupa ya maji inagharimu kama shilingi 500 hivi.

412
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:22,339
Nimeelewa.

413
00:24:22,363 --> 00:24:25,696
Nitununulia maji kwenye kituo cha nusu mlima.

414
00:24:25,719 --> 00:24:28,586
Hiyo ni uamuzi mzuri sana.

415
00:24:28,609 --> 00:24:32,542
Tafadhali, niambie hali ya hewa ya kilele cha mlima leo.

416
00:24:32,565 --> 00:24:37,332
Mvua itaanza kuwa na upepo mkali baada ya mchana, basi kuwa makini.

417
00:24:37,355 --> 00:24:40,488
Nitapanda akiwa nimevaa nguo za kupoza joto.

418
00:24:40,511 --> 00:24:45,009
Halijoto itashuka hadi nyuzi tano hivi kwenye kilele.

419
00:24:45,033 --> 00:24:48,999
Nina baragumu na kofia ya kupoza joto pia.

420
00:24:49,022 --> 00:24:51,956
Maandalizi mazuri sana!

421
00:24:51,979 --> 00:24:57,452
Kama najisikia vibaya kwa bahati mbaya, nifanye nini?

422
00:24:57,475 --> 00:25:03,875
Pumzika mara moja kwenye kibanda cha mlima kilicho karibu. Usipande kwa kufanya nguvu.

423
00:25:03,898 --> 00:25:08,876
Kwenye ramani ya mwongozo kuna namba za dharura.

424
00:25:08,900 --> 00:25:12,595
Nitahifadhi ramani ya mwongozo kwenye mfuko wangu.

425
00:25:12,618 --> 00:25:15,818
Panda kwa usalama wa kwanza.

426
00:25:15,841 --> 00:25:19,336
Nina taa ya kichwa kwenye begi langu pia.

427
00:25:19,359 --> 00:25:23,458
Ni salama kufika kibanda cha mlima kabla ya giza.

428
00:25:23,482 --> 00:25:27,016
Asante kwa maelezo mazuri.

429
00:25:27,039 --> 00:25:31,309
Furahia mandhari nzuri huko juu!

430
00:25:31,332 --> 00:25:33,765
Nitakuwa salama.

431
00:25:33,788 --> 00:25:36,421
Endelea na usalama.

432
00:25:36,444 --> 00:25:37,944
Sehemu ya 9: Kuingia Kibanda cha Mlima

433
00:25:37,944 --> 00:25:42,178
Samahani, ningependa kuingia.

434
00:25:42,201 --> 00:25:44,034
Karibu sana.

435
00:25:44,057 --> 00:25:48,156
Karibu kwenye kibanda cha mlima cha gogo nane.

436
00:25:48,180 --> 00:25:50,654
Nimefanya hifadhi, ni Maria.

437
00:25:50,678 --> 00:25:53,011
Maria, ndiyo?

438
00:25:53,034 --> 00:25:56,074
Tumehakikisha jina lako.

439
00:25:56,097 --> 00:25:59,236
Nimefanya hifadhi kwa watu wawili.

440
00:25:59,260 --> 00:26:03,593
Tumekupangia chumba kwa watu wawili.

441
00:26:03,616 --> 00:26:06,554
Tutalala wapi?

442
00:26:06,578 --> 00:26:11,944
Tafadhali tumia mifuko ya kulala nambari 12 na 13 kwenye ghorofa ya pili.

443
00:26:11,967 --> 00:26:16,401
Mifuko ya kulala imewekwa sambamba.

444
00:26:16,424 --> 00:26:20,197
Hii ni chumba kikubwa ambacho kitashirikishwa na wageni wengine.

445
00:26:20,220 --> 00:26:23,420
Nitahifadhi mizigo yangu wapi?

446
00:26:23,443 --> 00:26:27,677
Weka begi yako kwenye rafu iliyo juu ya kichwa chako.

447
00:26:27,700 --> 00:26:29,666
Nimeelewa.

448
00:26:29,689 --> 00:26:31,705
Nitaweka kwenye rafu.

449
00:26:31,729 --> 00:26:34,867
Chakula cha jioni kimeandaliwa tayari.

450
00:26:34,890 --> 00:26:37,857
Chakula cha jioni kitatumika hadi saa ngapi?

451
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:43,769
Chakula cha jioni kinaweza kuliwa katika ukumbi wa chakula kuanzia saa kumi na mbili jioni hadi saa moja usiku.

452
00:26:43,793 --> 00:26:47,026
Ni vyakula gani vitakavyopatikana kwa chakula cha jioni?

453
00:26:47,049 --> 00:26:52,016
Kutakuwa na wali wa karai moto na chai moto.

454
00:26:52,039 --> 00:26:57,015
Nimechemsha sana, kwa hiyo karai moto itanifurahisha sana.

455
00:26:57,038 --> 00:27:02,081
Kwenye mlima hufanya baridi sana, kwa hiyo kula vizuri.

456
00:27:02,105 --> 00:27:05,438
Nitakwenda ukumbini nikale.

457
00:27:05,461 --> 00:27:09,307
Ukumbi wa chakula uko ndani huko.

458
00:27:09,330 --> 00:27:13,812
Je, naweza kupata chakula cha asubuhi cha mfuko?

459
00:27:13,835 --> 00:27:17,914
Tutakupatia mfuko wa chakula wakati wa chakula cha jioni.

460
00:27:17,938 --> 00:27:22,738
Nitakula kilele cha mlima kesho asubuhi.

461
00:27:22,761 --> 00:27:26,728
Kesho tutaondoka saa ngapi kwenda kilele cha mlima?

462
00:27:26,750 --> 00:27:30,566
Tunataka kuondoka saa nane usiku.

463
00:27:30,590 --> 00:27:35,323
Saa nane usiku njia ya kupanda mlima huwa na msongamano mkubwa.

464
00:27:35,346 --> 00:27:38,948
Je, ni vyema kuondoka mapema zaidi?

465
00:27:38,972 --> 00:27:40,538
Ndiyo.

466
00:27:40,561 --> 00:27:44,833
Tunapendekeza kuondoka saa saba na nusu usiku.

467
00:27:44,856 --> 00:27:48,790
Nitaondoka saa saba na nusu usiku.

468
00:27:48,813 --> 00:27:54,213
Wakati wa kuzima taa nyumbani ni saa tisa jioni.

469
00:27:54,236 --> 00:27:58,304
Taa zitazimika saa tisa jioni.

470
00:27:58,327 --> 00:27:59,415
Ndiyo.

471
00:27:59,439 --> 00:28:03,572
Baada ya saa tisa jioni, pumzika kimya.

472
00:28:03,595 --> 00:28:07,195
Nitajiandaa taa ya kichwa.

473
00:28:07,218 --> 00:28:13,051
Tumia taa kwa kiwango kidogo ili usiwasumbue wengine.

474
00:28:13,074 --> 00:28:16,108
Nitajiandaa kimya na kwa tahadhari.

475
00:28:16,131 --> 00:28:19,799
Unaweza kununua maji au chai katika duka.

476
00:28:19,822 --> 00:28:23,588
Nataka kununua chupa ya maji moja.

477
00:28:23,611 --> 00:28:28,178
Bei ya maji ni shilingi mia tano kwa chupa moja.

478
00:28:28,201 --> 00:28:30,288
Nitakulipa shilingi mia tano.

479
00:28:30,312 --> 00:28:31,964
Asante sana.

480
00:28:31,987 --> 00:28:36,353
Pumzika polepole ili ujiunge tayari kwa kupanda mlima kesho.

481
00:28:36,376 --> 00:28:37,876
Sehemu ya 10: Kukodisha Vifaa vya Kupanda Mlima Fuji

482
00:28:37,876 --> 00:28:39,876
Samahani.

483
00:28:39,899 --> 00:28:43,833
Ningependa kukodisha vifaa vya kupanda Mlima Fuji.

484
00:28:43,856 --> 00:28:45,624
Karibu sana.

485
00:28:45,647 --> 00:28:50,014
Karibu katika duka la kukodisha vifaa vya kupanda mlima.

486
00:28:50,037 --> 00:28:54,332
Je, naweza kukodisha nguo za kupoza na taa ya kichwa?

487
00:28:54,355 --> 00:28:55,975
Ndiyo,

488
00:28:55,998 --> 00:29:00,598
Unaweza kukodisha seti hapa kwenye kona hii.

489
00:29:00,621 --> 00:29:03,863
Naweza kujaribu ukubwa?

490
00:29:03,887 --> 00:29:08,854
Kuna chumba cha kujaribu, unaweza kujaribu ili uone kama inakufaa.

491
00:29:08,877 --> 00:29:12,296
Nitavaa jaketi ya ukubwa wa M.

492
00:29:12,319 --> 00:29:14,124
Inakufaa vipi?

493
00:29:14,147 --> 00:29:16,442
Ukubwa unatosha?

494
00:29:16,466 --> 00:29:19,139
Inatosha vizuri.

495
00:29:19,162 --> 00:29:22,730
Je, ina uwezo wa kuzuia upepo na maji?

496
00:29:22,754 --> 00:29:24,354
Ndiyo,

497
00:29:24,377 --> 00:29:29,577
Ni ya nyenzo bora inayozuia upepo mkali na mvua kubwa.

498
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:32,867
Je, suruali zipo katika seti hiyo?

499
00:29:32,890 --> 00:29:34,424
Ndiyo,

500
00:29:34,447 --> 00:29:39,213
Seti hii ina jaketi na suruali za kupoza.

501
00:29:39,236 --> 00:29:43,636
Kwenye kilele cha mlima kuna baridi kama majira ya baridi, kwa hiyo ni salama.

502
00:29:43,659 --> 00:29:47,509
Sasa nitakupatia taa ya kichwa.

503
00:29:47,533 --> 00:29:51,666
Unaweza kunifundisha jinsi ya kutumia taa ya kichwa?

504
00:29:51,689 --> 00:29:56,022
Bonyeza kitufe cha juu ili kuwasha taa.

505
00:29:56,045 --> 00:29:59,120
Je, naweza kubadilisha mwangaza?

506
00:29:59,143 --> 00:30:04,511
Bonyeza kitufe mara mbili ili kuongeza mwangaza.

507
00:30:04,535 --> 00:30:07,735
Je, betri zimewekwa mpya?

508
00:30:07,758 --> 00:30:09,291
Ndiyo,

509
00:30:09,314 --> 00:30:13,530
Tumesetia betri mpya ya AA.

510
00:30:13,553 --> 00:30:16,886
Naweza kupata betri ya ziada?

511
00:30:16,909 --> 00:30:21,843
Unaweza kuongeza betri ya ziada kwa shilingi mia mbili zaidi.

512
00:30:21,866 --> 00:30:25,041
Tafadhali, naomba betri ya ziada pia.

513
00:30:25,064 --> 00:30:30,763
Sasisha ukanda wa mpira wa taa kulingana na ukubwa wa kichwa chako.

514
00:30:30,787 --> 00:30:32,920
Nimesonga ukanda.

515
00:30:32,943 --> 00:30:35,276
Imepatikana vizuri kabisa.

516
00:30:35,299 --> 00:30:39,699
Je, unahitaji spatsi au gaita za kupanda mlima?

517
00:30:39,722 --> 00:30:43,295
Hiyo ni kama kifuniko cha kuzuia mchanga kuingia, ndio?

518
00:30:43,319 --> 00:30:45,754
Ningependa kukodisha hiyo pia.

519
00:30:45,777 --> 00:30:50,196
Itakulinda miguu yako, nitaiweka kwenye seti.

520
00:30:50,219 --> 00:30:52,986
Nirudishie wapi?

521
00:30:53,009 --> 00:30:57,342
Unaweza kurudisha kwenye boksi ya kukusanya katika Nengo ya Tano.

522
00:30:57,365 --> 00:31:02,499
Kurudisha katika Nengo ya Tano ni rahisi sana, asante!

523
00:31:02,522 --> 00:31:07,000
Unaweza kurudisha hata ikiwa imechafuka na matope, hamna haja ya kuosha.

524
00:31:07,024 --> 00:31:10,065
Asante kwa kuniondoa taabu ya kuosha.

525
00:31:10,088 --> 00:31:14,661
Nitakokotoa gharama ya kukodisha kwa siku tatu za kulala.

526
00:31:14,685 --> 00:31:17,168
Jumla ni pesa ngapi?

527
00:31:17,191 --> 00:31:22,673
Gharama ya seti pamoja na bima ni shilingi elfu sita mia nane.

528
00:31:22,696 --> 00:31:25,463
Nitakulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo.

529
00:31:25,486 --> 00:31:29,653
Ndiyo, unaweza kulipa kwa kutumia malipo ya kugusa.

530
00:31:29,676 --> 00:31:31,957
Nimemaliza malipo.

531
00:31:31,980 --> 00:31:35,180
Umeiweka katika mfuko mkubwa, asante!

532
00:31:35,203 --> 00:31:39,222
Unaweza kutuma mfuko huu kama ulivyo katika Nengo ya Tano.

533
00:31:39,245 --> 00:31:43,457
Tutakusaidia kupakia katika basi la haraka, hakuna matatizo.

534
00:31:43,480 --> 00:31:47,251
Uwe na safari salama na nzuri ya kupanda mlima.

535
00:31:47,274 --> 00:31:48,774
Sehemu ya 11: Urahisi wa Malipo ya Kugusa

536
00:31:48,774 --> 00:31:52,389
Uliuona habari za asubuhi?

537
00:31:52,413 --> 00:31:55,614
Hapana, sikuziona.

538
00:31:55,638 --> 00:31:57,839
Habari gani?

539
00:31:57,862 --> 00:32:03,628
Habari kuhusu ongezeko la malipo ya kugusa katika maduka nchini Japani.

540
00:32:03,651 --> 00:32:06,296
Malipo ya kugusa?

541
00:32:06,320 --> 00:32:10,694
Ndiyo, kulipa kwa kuonyesha kadi au simu.

542
00:32:10,718 --> 00:32:12,285
Ndiyo,

543
00:32:12,308 --> 00:32:18,241
Unaweza kununua haraka bila kutumia sarafu.

544
00:32:18,264 --> 00:32:24,633
Hii ni rahisi sana kwa watalii wa kigeni.

545
00:32:24,657 --> 00:32:29,457
Je, naweza kutumia malipo ya kugusa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

546
00:32:29,479 --> 00:32:31,218
Ndiyo,

547
00:32:31,242 --> 00:32:36,691
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia malipo ya kugusa kwa kadi za kimataifa.

548
00:32:36,714 --> 00:32:42,603
Naweza kutumia Apple Pay au Google Pay kwa simu yangu?

549
00:32:42,627 --> 00:32:44,124
Ndiyo,

550
00:32:44,148 --> 00:32:48,714
Unaweza kulipa kwa kuonyesha tu simu yako kwenye kifaa.

551
00:32:48,737 --> 00:32:54,737
Je, sihitaji kuingiza nambari ya siri kwenye kituo cha malipo?

552
00:32:54,760 --> 00:33:00,394
Kwa kiasi fulani cha pesa, huna haja ya sahihi wala nambari ya siri.

553
00:33:00,417 --> 00:33:04,435
Hii inafanya malipo kuwa haraka sana.

554
00:33:04,459 --> 00:33:09,952
Hakuna msongamano kwenye malipo, na hii inapunguza mfadhaiko.

555
00:33:09,975 --> 00:33:14,375
Je, mchakato wa kutozwa ushuru pia unaendelea kidigitali?

556
00:33:14,398 --> 00:33:16,134
Ndiyo,

557
00:33:16,158 --> 00:33:20,891
Unaweza kusoma pasipoti kwa kifaa tu, ni rahisi sana.

558
00:33:20,914 --> 00:33:26,988
Risiti za kielektroniki zimeongezeka badala ya za karatasi.

559
00:33:27,012 --> 00:33:32,212
Unaweza kupokea risiti kwa barua pepe au programu.

560
00:33:32,235 --> 00:33:37,045
Mkoba wako hautajaa na risiti za karatasi.

561
00:33:37,068 --> 00:33:41,201
Hii ni mfumo mzuri kwa mazingira pia.

562
00:33:41,224 --> 00:33:45,200
Naweza kutumia malipo ya kugusa katika maduka ya haraka au maduka makubwa?

563
00:33:45,224 --> 00:33:47,024
Ndiyo,

564
00:33:47,047 --> 00:33:50,523
Karibu maduka yote ya minyororo yanakubali malipo haya.

565
00:33:50,547 --> 00:33:55,914
Je, malipo ya kugusa yameongezeka hata katika maeneo ya utalii vijijini?

566
00:33:55,937 --> 00:33:57,670
Ndiyo,

567
00:33:57,693 --> 00:34:02,326
Malipo kwa kugusa yanazidi kuenea hata kwenye mabasi na treni.

568
00:34:02,349 --> 00:34:07,349
Unaweza kupita kwenye lango bila kununua tiketi.

569
00:34:07,372 --> 00:34:12,306
Unaweza kupanda kwa kutumia kadi ya kawaida ya mkopo.

570
00:34:12,329 --> 00:34:17,974
Ununuzi na usafiri nchini Japani umekuwa rahisi sana.

571
00:34:17,997 --> 00:34:19,564
Ndiyo,

572
00:34:19,587 --> 00:34:23,059
Huna haja ya kuwa na wasiwasi wa kuandaa pesa taslimu.

573
00:34:23,082 --> 00:34:27,849
Ninapata furaha kwa sababu sijakua mzuri katika kukokotoa sarafu ndogo.

574
00:34:27,872 --> 00:34:34,328
Kifaa nyingi kina skrini zinazosaidia Kiingereza na lugha nyingi.

575
00:34:34,352 --> 00:34:39,885
Hata kama hautaelewani na mfanyakazi, unaweza kufanya shughuli kupitia skrini.

576
00:34:39,908 --> 00:34:45,400
Unaweza kufurahia utalii bila wasiwasi na kwa raha.

577
00:34:45,423 --> 00:34:49,557
Leo hii tutatumia malipo kwa kugusa hata katika duka hili.

578
00:34:49,580 --> 00:34:54,413
Shikilia kadi yako hadi itakapotoa sauti ya 'pip'.

579
00:34:54,436 --> 00:34:58,312
Asante kwa kunionyesha jinsi hii.

580
00:34:58,336 --> 00:35:02,336
Furahia ununuzi wa raha.

581
00:35:02,359 --> 00:35:07,202
Nitathibitisha ikiwa kadi yangu inasaidia malipo kwa kugusa.

582
00:35:07,225 --> 00:35:11,859
Ikiwa kadi yako ina alama ya wimbi, basi itafanya kazi.

583
00:35:11,883 --> 00:35:15,516
Aa, kadi yangu ina alama ya wimbi.

584
00:35:15,539 --> 00:35:19,838
Basi unaweza kutumia malipo kwa kugusa.

585
00:35:19,862 --> 00:35:23,795
Nitakwenda mara moja kununua vitu kwa kutumia kadi yangu.

586
00:35:23,818 --> 00:35:25,318
Sehemu ya 12: Mazungumzo Wakati wa Ununuzi / Mazungumzo ya Ununuzi ya Msingi

587
00:35:25,318 --> 00:35:29,005
Samahani, naomba hii.

588
00:35:29,029 --> 00:35:31,196
Karibu sana.

589
00:35:31,219 --> 00:35:34,352
Hii ni bento na chai, ndiyo?

590
00:35:34,375 --> 00:35:38,342
Ndiyo, bento na chai.

591
00:35:38,365 --> 00:35:42,532
Je, ungependa bento iwe ikainuliwa joto kwa microwave?

592
00:35:42,555 --> 00:35:45,927
Ndiyo, tafadhali inulishe joto.

593
00:35:45,951 --> 00:35:48,084
Nimeelewa.

594
00:35:48,107 --> 00:35:52,947
Nitainua joto kwa wati 500 kwa sekunde 40.

595
00:35:52,971 --> 00:35:54,646
Asante sana.

596
00:35:54,669 --> 00:35:58,204
Ninapenda kula bento iliyoinuliwa joto.

597
00:35:58,227 --> 00:36:03,260
Je, ungependa mfuko wa plastiki wa duka?

598
00:36:03,283 --> 00:36:09,217
Hapana, nina mfuko wangu wa kibinafsi.

599
00:36:09,240 --> 00:36:11,107
Nimekuelewa.

600
00:36:11,130 --> 00:36:14,463
Nitaiweka katika mfuko wako wa kibinafsi.

601
00:36:14,486 --> 00:36:16,020
Asante sana.

602
00:36:16,043 --> 00:36:19,136
Naomba unaweza kunipa uma moja?

603
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:24,566
Ndiyo, nitaiweka uma na kitambaa cha kusafisha mikono.

604
00:36:24,589 --> 00:36:27,234
Naomba pia kijiko cha chai.

605
00:36:27,258 --> 00:36:30,791
Nitakujaza kijiko pia.

606
00:36:30,814 --> 00:36:34,500
Jumla ni pesa ngapi?

607
00:36:34,523 --> 00:36:38,982
Jumla ni yen 780.

608
00:36:39,006 --> 00:36:43,373
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo kwa kugusa?

609
00:36:43,396 --> 00:36:49,362
Ndiyo, unaweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo kwa kugusa.

610
00:36:49,385 --> 00:36:53,359
Je, naweza kutumia Apple Pay kwa simu yangu?

611
00:36:53,383 --> 00:36:58,316
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia Apple Pay pia.

612
00:36:58,339 --> 00:37:01,116
Nitakulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo.

613
00:37:01,139 --> 00:37:03,273
Je, naomba nikilie skrini?

614
00:37:03,297 --> 00:37:09,335
Gusa kitufe cha kadi ya mkopo kwenye skrini.

615
00:37:09,359 --> 00:37:10,959
Nimeshaigusa.

616
00:37:10,982 --> 00:37:14,116
Nikae kadi yangu wapi?

617
00:37:14,139 --> 00:37:19,172
Wekea kadi yako juu ya kifaa kinachoangaza rangi ya buluu.

618
00:37:19,195 --> 00:37:22,462
Nitaiweka hapa kadi yangu.

619
00:37:22,485 --> 00:37:26,779
Shikilia hapo hadi itakapotoka sauti ya 'pip'.

620
00:37:26,803 --> 00:37:29,736
Imefanya sauti ya 'piroon'.

621
00:37:29,759 --> 00:37:32,294
Malipo yamekamilika.

622
00:37:32,318 --> 00:37:34,851
Chukua kadi yako.

623
00:37:34,874 --> 00:37:38,647
Je, haitaji sahihi wala nambari ya siri?

624
00:37:38,671 --> 00:37:45,076
Ndiyo, kwa sababu ni kiasi kidogo, haitaji sahihi wala nambari ya siri.

625
00:37:45,099 --> 00:37:47,974
Ni haraka sana na rahisi!

626
00:37:47,997 --> 00:37:50,997
Nitakupatia risiti yako.

627
00:37:51,020 --> 00:37:54,654
Je, naweza kupata risiti ya kielektroniki?

628
00:37:54,677 --> 00:37:59,810
Ndiyo, piga picha kwa QR code kwenye skrini kwa kutumia simu yako.

629
00:37:59,833 --> 00:38:02,067
Nimeshapiga picha.

630
00:38:02,090 --> 00:38:05,690
Risiti imefika kwenye simu yako.

631
00:38:05,713 --> 00:38:10,079
Unaweza kuhifadhi bila kutumia karatasi, sawa?

632
00:38:10,102 --> 00:38:14,950
Ndiyo, nafaa sana kwa kuweka pochi yangu vizuri.

633
00:38:14,973 --> 00:38:18,973
Nitakuletea chakula cha jioni chenye joto.

634
00:38:18,996 --> 00:38:22,483
Asante kwa kunihudumia kwa uangalifu.

635
00:38:22,507 --> 00:38:23,940
Asante sana.

636
00:38:23,963 --> 00:38:27,330
Tunangojea tena kwa kununua kwako.

637
00:38:27,353 --> 00:38:28,853
Sehemu ya 13: Jinsi ya Kutumia Self-Checkout / Jinsi ya Kutumia Mashine ya Self-Checkout

638
00:38:28,853 --> 00:38:30,820
Samahani.

639
00:38:30,843 --> 00:38:34,454
Tafadhali unionyeshe jinsi ya kutumia self-checkout.

640
00:38:34,477 --> 00:38:35,811
Ndiyo.

641
00:38:35,834 --> 00:38:38,000
Nitakusaidia.

642
00:38:38,023 --> 00:38:41,223
Gusa skrini.

643
00:38:41,246 --> 00:38:46,330
Je, naweza kubadilisha lugha ya skrini kuwa Kiingereza?

644
00:38:46,354 --> 00:38:47,989
Ndiyo.

645
00:38:48,013 --> 00:38:52,746
Bonyeza kitufe cha English kwenye kona ya kulia juu.

646
00:38:52,769 --> 00:38:55,659
Skrini imegeuka Kiingereza.

647
00:38:55,683 --> 00:38:58,616
Nifanye nini kisha?

648
00:38:58,639 --> 00:39:03,850
Onyesha barcode ya bidhaa kwenye skena inayong'ara nyekundu.

649
00:39:03,873 --> 00:39:08,770
Nitaonyesha barcode ya chakula cha kidogo.

650
00:39:08,793 --> 00:39:11,881
Imepiga sauti 'pip'.

651
00:39:11,904 --> 00:39:14,704
Jina la bidhaa limeonekana kwenye skrini.

652
00:39:14,727 --> 00:39:18,961
Tufaha hili halina barcode.

653
00:39:18,984 --> 00:39:24,855
Bonyeza kitufe cha bidhaa zisizo na barcode kwenye skrini.

654
00:39:24,878 --> 00:39:30,478
Chagua tufaha kutoka kwa aikoni ya matunda.

655
00:39:30,501 --> 00:39:31,951
Ndiyo.

656
00:39:31,975 --> 00:39:35,775
Chagua tufaha moja na gusa skrini.

657
00:39:35,798 --> 00:39:39,365
Imeandikishwa.

658
00:39:39,388 --> 00:39:44,721
Je, nifanyeje na nyama yenye stika ya punguzo la asilimia 20?

659
00:39:44,744 --> 00:39:49,678
Soma barcode ya stika ya punguzo kama ilivyo.

660
00:39:49,701 --> 00:39:54,837
Imepiga sauti 'pip' na bei imepungua kwa asilimia 20.

661
00:39:54,860 --> 00:39:58,860
Umesoma vizuri.

662
00:39:58,883 --> 00:40:02,662
Ninataka kununua mfuko wa plastiki mmoja.

663
00:40:02,686 --> 00:40:09,252
Bonyeza kitufe cha 'Nahitaji mfuko' kwenye skrini na uchague mmoja.

664
00:40:09,275 --> 00:40:12,523
Nimechagua mmoja.

665
00:40:12,547 --> 00:40:15,422
Mifuko iko wapi?

666
00:40:15,446 --> 00:40:21,112
Kando ya self-checkout kuna mifuko inayolipika shilingi tano.

667
00:40:21,135 --> 00:40:25,582
Kama nina mfuko wangu, naweka wapi?

668
00:40:25,605 --> 00:40:31,205
Weka mfuko wako kwenye jukwaa la kupima uzito upande wa kushoto.

669
00:40:31,228 --> 00:40:35,869
Sensor ya uzito inatazama uzito.

670
00:40:35,893 --> 00:40:41,260
Weka bidhaa ulizosoma mara moja ndani ya mfuko.

671
00:40:41,283 --> 00:40:44,735
Imepiga sauti ya onyo 'pii'.

672
00:40:44,759 --> 00:40:46,364
Kwa nini?

673
00:40:46,387 --> 00:40:50,753
Kwa sababu ulihamisha mfuko kabla ya kuweka bidhaa.

674
00:40:50,776 --> 00:40:53,344
Nitaifuta.

675
00:40:53,368 --> 00:40:54,935
Asante sana.

676
00:40:54,958 --> 00:40:57,253
Hitilafu imetoweka.

677
00:40:57,276 --> 00:41:00,209
Endelea na mchakato wa malipo.

678
00:41:00,232 --> 00:41:02,999
Tafadhali bonyeza kitufe cha malipo.

679
00:41:03,022 --> 00:41:05,856
Chagua njia ya malipo.

680
00:41:05,879 --> 00:41:09,113
Je, naweza kutumia malipo kwa kugusa?

681
00:41:09,136 --> 00:41:14,029
Ndiyo, unaweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo kwa kugusa.

682
00:41:14,052 --> 00:41:18,585
Bonyeza kitufe cha kadi ya mkopo.

683
00:41:18,608 --> 00:41:23,085
Gusa kadi yako kwenye kifaa cha kadi kinachong'aa upande wa kulia.

684
00:41:23,108 --> 00:41:27,382
Shikilia hadi itakapotoa sauti ya 'pip'.

685
00:41:27,406 --> 00:41:29,739
Malipo yamekamilika.

686
00:41:29,762 --> 00:41:32,129
Chukua kadi yako.

687
00:41:32,152 --> 00:41:35,201
Risiti na hundi zimetoka.

688
00:41:35,225 --> 00:41:40,591
Hifadhi hundi kwa sababu inahitajika wakati wa kurudisha bidhaa.

689
00:41:40,614 --> 00:41:42,348
Nimeelewa.

690
00:41:42,371 --> 00:41:44,773
Nitaweka kwenye pochi yangu.

691
00:41:44,797 --> 00:41:48,963
Umechoka na matumizi ya self-checkout, asante sana!

692
00:41:48,986 --> 00:41:53,820
Kwa msaada wa maelekezo kwa Kiingereza, nilifaulu kutumia kifaa hivi kwa urahisi.

693
00:41:53,843 --> 00:41:55,327
Asante sana.

694
00:41:55,350 --> 00:41:57,684
Karibu tena!

695
00:41:57,707 --> 00:41:59,207
Sehemu ya 14: Jinsi ya Kutumia Risiti ya Kidigitali / How to Use Digital Receipts

696
00:41:59,207 --> 00:42:01,042
Samahani.

697
00:42:01,065 --> 00:42:04,832
Tafadhali hesabu nguo hizi na mkoba.

698
00:42:04,855 --> 00:42:06,551
Karibu sana.

699
00:42:06,574 --> 00:42:08,413
Asante sana.

700
00:42:08,436 --> 00:42:12,318
Je, naweza kupata risiti ya kidigitali?

701
00:42:12,342 --> 00:42:13,708
Ndiyo.

702
00:42:13,731 --> 00:42:18,398
Tunaweza kukutoa risiti ya kidigitali isiyohitaji karatasi.

703
00:42:18,421 --> 00:42:21,788
Ni mfumo usiotumia karatasi kwa risiti.

704
00:42:21,811 --> 00:42:23,344
Ndiyo.

705
00:42:23,367 --> 00:42:27,434
Tutatumia moja kwa moja data ya risiti kwenye simu yako.

706
00:42:27,457 --> 00:42:30,099
Ungependa kupokea vipi?

707
00:42:30,123 --> 00:42:35,123
Tafadhali piga picha kodi ya QR inayofunika kwenye skrini ya kifaa kwa simu yako.

708
00:42:35,146 --> 00:42:37,635
Nitapiga picha kwa kamera.

709
00:42:37,658 --> 00:42:40,392
Imepigwa picha vizuri.

710
00:42:40,415 --> 00:42:42,900
Je, skrini imefunguka?

711
00:42:42,924 --> 00:42:43,990
Ndiyo.

712
00:42:44,013 --> 00:42:47,660
Skrini ya kuingiza anwani ya barua pepe imetokea.

713
00:42:47,684 --> 00:42:51,250
Tafadhali ingiza anwani ya barua pepe unayotumia.

714
00:42:51,273 --> 00:42:54,206
Nimeingiza anwani ya barua pepe.

715
00:42:54,229 --> 00:42:56,763
Bonyeza kitufe cha kutuma.

716
00:42:56,786 --> 00:42:58,186
Ndiyo.

717
00:42:58,209 --> 00:43:00,475
Ujumbe umetumwa kikamilifu.

718
00:43:00,498 --> 00:43:04,032
Risiti ya kidigitali imefika kwenye simu yako.

719
00:43:04,055 --> 00:43:05,621
Nimeithibitisha.

720
00:43:05,644 --> 00:43:07,411
Asante sana.

721
00:43:07,434 --> 00:43:10,246
Imefika salama, hivyo.

722
00:43:10,270 --> 00:43:14,109
Ni rahisi kwa sababu pochi yangu haitajiki kujaa karatasi.

723
00:43:14,132 --> 00:43:19,500
Ni nzuri kwa mazingira na wateja wanapenda sana.

724
00:43:19,524 --> 00:43:24,421
Je, naweza kutumia risiti hii ya kidigitali kwa mchakato wa kutozwa ushuru?

725
00:43:24,444 --> 00:43:25,778
Ndiyo.

726
00:43:25,801 --> 00:43:30,138
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia risiti ya kidigitali kwa mchakato wa kutozwa ushuru.

727
00:43:30,161 --> 00:43:33,295
Ningependa kutumia kwenye kaunta ya kutozwa ushuru.

728
00:43:33,318 --> 00:43:37,813
Tafadhali onyesha skrini ya simu yako kwenye kaunta ya kutozwa ushuru ya ghorofa ya tano.

729
00:43:37,836 --> 00:43:41,236
Je, ni kutosha kuonyesha skrini ya simu?

730
00:43:41,259 --> 00:43:42,676
Ndiyo.

731
00:43:42,700 --> 00:43:46,194
Mfanyakazi atapiga picha barcode kwenye skrini yako.

732
00:43:46,217 --> 00:43:50,296
Unaweza kutumia kama risiti ya kawaida.

733
00:43:50,320 --> 00:43:51,720
Ndiyo.

734
00:43:51,743 --> 00:43:55,759
Ina athari sawa kabisa, usijali.

735
00:43:55,782 --> 00:43:59,439
Je, naweza kutumia wakati wa kurudisha au kubadilisha bidhaa?

736
00:43:59,463 --> 00:44:04,033
Wakati wa kurudisha bidhaa, onyesha tu risiti ya kidigitali.

737
00:44:04,057 --> 00:44:07,940
Nashukuru kwa sababu sitaogopa kupoteza risiti.

738
00:44:07,963 --> 00:44:12,096
Jumla ya malipo ni shilingi kumi na mbili elfu.

739
00:44:12,119 --> 00:44:15,653
Nitamlipa kwa kadi ya mkopo kwa kugusa.

740
00:44:15,676 --> 00:44:18,171
Tafadhali gusa kadi yako kwenye kifaa cha malipo.

741
00:44:18,195 --> 00:44:19,828
Nimeshaigusa.

742
00:44:19,852 --> 00:44:22,852
Imeutoa sauti ya 'piroon'.

743
00:44:22,875 --> 00:44:25,154
Malipo yamekamilika.

744
00:44:25,178 --> 00:44:29,945
Risiti ya kidigitali na maelezo ya malipo yamehifadhiwa vizuri.

745
00:44:29,968 --> 00:44:33,935
Tutakujaza bidhaa kwenye mfuko vizuri na kukujaza.

746
00:44:33,958 --> 00:44:37,094
Asante kwa kunipachika kwa uangalifu.

747
00:44:37,117 --> 00:44:41,084
Tafadhali endelea hadi kaunta ya bidhaa zisizohitajika kwenye ghorofa ya tano.

748
00:44:41,107 --> 00:44:42,445
Nimeelewa.

749
00:44:42,468 --> 00:44:44,468
Nitakwenda kwa lifti.

750
00:44:44,491 --> 00:44:46,291
Asante sana.

751
00:44:46,314 --> 00:44:49,248
Furahia ununuzi wako.

752
00:44:49,271 --> 00:44:50,771
Sehemu ya 15: Jinsi ya Kutumia Mfumo wa Kuagiza kwa Kodi ya QR / How to Use QR Code Ordering

753
00:44:50,771 --> 00:44:52,642
Samahani.

754
00:44:52,666 --> 00:44:54,506
Tuko wawili.

755
00:44:54,529 --> 00:44:56,611
Je, mnaweza kuingia?

756
00:44:56,635 --> 00:44:58,681
Karibu sana.

757
00:44:58,705 --> 00:45:02,271
Karibu kiti hiki cha meza.

758
00:45:02,294 --> 00:45:03,987
Asante sana.

759
00:45:04,011 --> 00:45:07,744
Je, naweza kupata menyu?

760
00:45:07,767 --> 00:45:13,701
Dukani kwetu, mfumo wa kuagiza ni kupitia kodi ya QR kwenye meza.

761
00:45:13,724 --> 00:45:17,000
Kuagiza kwa kodi ya QR, basi?

762
00:45:17,023 --> 00:45:20,757
Je, utatumia simu yako mwenyewe?

763
00:45:20,780 --> 00:45:22,277
Ndiyo.

764
00:45:22,300 --> 00:45:27,342
Tafadhali piga picha kodi ya QR kwenye stendi hii kwa kamera yako.

765
00:45:27,365 --> 00:45:29,899
Nimeshapiga picha kwa kamera.

766
00:45:29,922 --> 00:45:33,322
Menyu imefunguka!

767
00:45:33,345 --> 00:45:39,415
Unaweza kubadilisha lugha hadi Kiingereza kwenye sehemu ya kulia juu ya skrini.

768
00:45:39,438 --> 00:45:42,006
Imebadilishwa kuwa Kiingereza.

769
00:45:42,030 --> 00:45:46,502
Kuna picha na ni rahisi kuelewa.

770
00:45:46,526 --> 00:45:51,492
Chagua chakula unachotaka na uziweke kwenye kikapu.

771
00:45:51,515 --> 00:45:57,849
Nitachagua ramen ya mifupa ya nguruwe na sahani ya tempura.

772
00:45:57,872 --> 00:46:02,353
Unaweza kuchagua ugumu wa unga wa ramen pia.

773
00:46:02,377 --> 00:46:05,210
Nitachagua ugumu zaidi.

774
00:46:05,233 --> 00:46:09,906
Nitawajia mayai yaliyochemshwa kama nyongeza.

775
00:46:09,930 --> 00:46:14,869
Thibitisha kikapu chako kisha bonyeza kitufe cha kuthibitisha agizo.

776
00:46:14,893 --> 00:46:18,227
Nimebonyeza kitufe cha kuthibitisha agizo.

777
00:46:18,250 --> 00:46:19,784
Ndiyo.

778
00:46:19,807 --> 00:46:22,973
Agizo limefika jikoni.

779
00:46:22,996 --> 00:46:30,363
Umeweza kuagiza bila kutumia menyu ya karatasi, rahisi sana!

780
00:46:30,386 --> 00:46:33,319
Tumekuletea maji baridi na kitambaa cha kunywa mikono.

781
00:46:33,342 --> 00:46:34,876
Asante sana.

782
00:46:34,899 --> 00:46:39,365
Je, ungependa kuagiza maji mengine kwa simu yako?

783
00:46:39,388 --> 00:46:40,878
Ndiyo.

784
00:46:40,902 --> 00:46:46,635
Unaweza kuagiza maji mengine bure kupitia kikapu.

785
00:46:46,658 --> 00:46:51,592
Ni rahisi sana kuagiza maji bure!

786
00:46:51,615 --> 00:46:53,860
Tumekuletea.

787
00:46:53,883 --> 00:46:57,083
Hii ni ramen ya mifupa ya nguruwe na tempura.

788
00:46:57,106 --> 00:47:00,559
Ramen hii ni nzuri sana!

789
00:47:00,583 --> 00:47:02,184
Tunashukuru.

790
00:47:02,208 --> 00:47:05,741
Karibu kufurahia chakula chako.

791
00:47:05,764 --> 00:47:10,698
Supu ya ramen hii ni tamu sana na nzuri!

792
00:47:10,721 --> 00:47:12,287
Asante sana.

793
00:47:12,310 --> 00:47:15,344
Je, ungependa kuagiza chakula kingine?

794
00:47:15,368 --> 00:47:20,368
Nitakuagiza aiskrimu ya matcha moja.

795
00:47:20,391 --> 00:47:25,057
Tafadhali agiza desseti kutoka skrini ya simu yako.

796
00:47:25,080 --> 00:47:28,814
Nimeagiza aiskrimu ya matcha kama nyongeza.

797
00:47:28,837 --> 00:47:31,970
Tumekuletea aiskrimu ya matcha.

798
00:47:31,993 --> 00:47:34,404
Karibu.

799
00:47:34,428 --> 00:47:36,161
Ilikuwa tamu sana!

800
00:47:36,184 --> 00:47:38,674
Asante kwa chakula.

801
00:47:38,698 --> 00:47:42,710
Tutakupatia mchakato wa malipo.

802
00:47:42,734 --> 00:47:46,867
Je, naweza kulipa kwa simu pia?

803
00:47:46,890 --> 00:47:48,367
Ndiyo.

804
00:47:48,391 --> 00:47:53,631
Bonyeza 'Malipo' kwenye skrini, naweza kulipa kwa PayPay.

805
00:47:53,654 --> 00:47:58,654
Nitakulipa kwa kuonyesha barakoa ya PayPay.

806
00:47:58,677 --> 00:48:02,810
Tafadhali onyesha skrini ya simu yako kwenye mashine ya kumbukumbu.

807
00:48:02,833 --> 00:48:07,600
Hakika utasikia sauti na malipo yatakamilika.

808
00:48:07,623 --> 00:48:10,189
Tumethibitisha malipo yako.

809
00:48:10,212 --> 00:48:11,779
Asante sana.

810
00:48:11,802 --> 00:48:16,275
Kulipa bili kwenye meza kulikuwa rahisi sana.

811
00:48:16,298 --> 00:48:20,544
Ikiwa unahitaji risiti, tutakupa kwenye kumbukumbu.

812
00:48:20,567 --> 00:48:23,025
Nitapokea risiti.

813
00:48:23,049 --> 00:48:24,941
Asante sana.

814
00:48:24,965 --> 00:48:26,498
Asante sana.

815
00:48:26,521 --> 00:48:29,091
Karibu tena!

816
00:48:29,115 --> 00:48:30,615
Sehemu ya 16: Wafanyakazi wa Idara ya Uhamiaji Wameongezwa ili Kupunguza Muda wa Kungoja

817
00:48:30,615 --> 00:48:34,348
Umeangalia habari za asubuhi?

818
00:48:34,371 --> 00:48:37,177
Hapana, sijawaona.

819
00:48:37,200 --> 00:48:39,485
Habari gani?

820
00:48:39,508 --> 00:48:44,516
Habari za Mamlaka ya Udhibiti wa Kuingia na Kukaa nchini.

821
00:48:44,539 --> 00:48:47,106
Habari za idara ya uhamiaji, basi.

822
00:48:47,129 --> 00:48:49,495
Ni habari gani hasa?

823
00:48:49,518 --> 00:48:55,285
Wataongeza wafanyakazi zaidi ya watu mia mbili na ishirini kwenye madirisha ya huduma.

824
00:48:55,308 --> 00:48:58,441
Wataongeza wafanyakazi?

825
00:48:58,464 --> 00:49:01,546
Haitakuwa na msongamano tena.

826
00:49:01,570 --> 00:49:05,849
Kwa sababu wageni wanaoishi Japani wameongezeka.

827
00:49:05,873 --> 00:49:12,345
Idara ya uhamiaji huko Shinagawa kila wakati huwa na msongamano mkubwa.

828
00:49:12,368 --> 00:49:17,218
Ndiyo, wakati mwingine huwa na hata saa kadhaa za kungoja, ni vigumu sana.

829
00:49:17,241 --> 00:49:22,174
Wafanyakazi wakiongezeka, muda wa kungoja utapungua.

830
00:49:22,197 --> 00:49:26,371
Wataongeza pia wafanyakazi wanaozungumza lugha nyingi.

831
00:49:26,395 --> 00:49:30,828
Je, naweza kupata ushauri kwa Kiingereza au Kichina?

832
00:49:30,851 --> 00:49:38,018
Ndiyo, unaweza kupata ushauri kwa Kiingereza, Kichina, na Kivietinamu.

833
00:49:38,041 --> 00:49:43,613
Ni faraja kwa wageni wasio na uhakika wa Kijapani.

834
00:49:43,636 --> 00:49:48,912
Mchakato wa kusasisha hati za kukaa utakuwa rahisi zaidi.

835
00:49:48,936 --> 00:49:53,308
Je, naweza kufanya maombi ya mtandaoni?

836
00:49:53,331 --> 00:49:58,465
Ndiyo, watakuwa na maelekezo zaidi kwa maombi ya mtandaoni.

837
00:49:58,488 --> 00:50:03,454
Kutokuwa na haja ya kwenda kwenye madirisha kunisaidia sana.

838
00:50:03,477 --> 00:50:08,316
Mfumo wa kupanga kwa simu pia utaanzishwa upya.

839
00:50:08,340 --> 00:50:12,815
Nitapanga kwa simu au mtandaoni kwanza kabla ya kwenda.

840
00:50:12,838 --> 00:50:17,438
Ndiyo, muda wa kungoja bure hautakuwepo tena.

841
00:50:17,461 --> 00:50:22,904
Je, naweza kushauriana kuhusu mabadiliko ya kadi ya kukaa au anwani?

842
00:50:22,928 --> 00:50:28,397
Ndiyo, unaweza kupata ushauri kwenye kituo cha habari.

843
00:50:28,420 --> 00:50:31,066
Je, ushauri ni bure?

844
00:50:31,090 --> 00:50:36,363
Ndiyo, ni bure na watakuelekeza kwa huruma.

845
00:50:36,386 --> 00:50:40,820
Mwezi ujao nitaweza kusasisha kadi yangu ya kukaa.

846
00:50:40,843 --> 00:50:45,609
Ni vizuri kutumia mfumo mpya kwa kupanga.

847
00:50:45,632 --> 00:50:49,199
Nitakamilisha hati zangu mtandaoni.

848
00:50:49,222 --> 00:50:54,555
Ikiwa kuna jambo lisilo wazi, uliza kwa simu kwenye madirisha ya huduma.

849
00:50:54,578 --> 00:50:58,272
Tafadhali nipatie nambari ya simu kwa ushauri wa Kiingereza.

850
00:50:58,296 --> 00:51:02,429
Nambari ipo kwenye tovuti rasmi.

851
00:51:02,452 --> 00:51:05,819
Nitatazama tovuti leo usiku.

852
00:51:05,842 --> 00:51:11,208
Tumia mchakato sahihi ili uishi Japani kwa amani.

853
00:51:11,231 --> 00:51:15,512
Asante kwa kunishirikisha habari hizi muhimu.

854
00:51:15,536 --> 00:51:18,770
Nafurahi habari hizi ziliwaweza kuwasaidia.

855
00:51:18,793 --> 00:51:23,759
Nitapambana ili kusasisha hati zangu vizuri.

856
00:51:23,782 --> 00:51:26,316
Nakuunga mkono.

857
00:51:26,339 --> 00:51:28,195
Asante sana.

858
00:51:28,219 --> 00:51:32,619
Ikiwa kuna habari nyingine, nitakuambia.

859
00:51:32,642 --> 00:51:35,218
Asante, nitakuuliza.

860
00:51:35,241 --> 00:51:36,741
Sehemu ya 17: Mchakato wa Kusasisha Kadi ya Kukaa

861
00:51:36,741 --> 00:51:38,608
Samahani.

862
00:51:38,631 --> 00:51:42,598
Ninataka kusasisha kadi yangu ya kukaa.

863
00:51:42,621 --> 00:51:44,315
Karibu sana.

864
00:51:44,338 --> 00:51:47,623
Tafadhali nendeni kwenye kaunta ya B.

865
00:51:47,647 --> 00:51:51,886
Je, ni lazima nichukue tiketi ya namba kwenye mashine ya kutolea tiketi?

866
00:51:51,910 --> 00:51:53,243
Ndiyo.

867
00:51:53,266 --> 00:51:57,700
Bonyeza kitufe cha buluu ili kuchukua tiketi yako ya namba.

868
00:51:57,723 --> 00:52:00,338
Nimechukua tiketi yangu ya namba.

869
00:52:00,361 --> 00:52:03,561
Inaandikwa 'B-15'.

870
00:52:03,585 --> 00:52:08,458
Nambari yako itaonyeshwa kwenye skrini wakati wa zamu yako.

871
00:52:08,482 --> 00:52:12,171
Nitazingatia nambari kwenye skrini na nitarudi.

872
00:52:12,195 --> 00:52:15,402
Je, umejaza fomu ya maombi?

873
00:52:15,426 --> 00:52:16,892
Ndiyo.

874
00:52:16,915 --> 00:52:20,365
Nimejaza fomu ya maombi nyumbani.

875
00:52:20,389 --> 00:52:25,401
Mteja wa nambari B-15, tafadhali nendeni kwenye dirisha la kwanza.

876
00:52:25,424 --> 00:52:27,897
Dirisha la kwanza, sawa.

877
00:52:27,920 --> 00:52:30,054
Nitashukuru.

878
00:52:30,077 --> 00:52:33,447
Ni maombi ya kusasisha kipindi cha kukaa nchini.

879
00:52:33,471 --> 00:52:36,160
Tutakupokea hati zako.

880
00:52:36,183 --> 00:52:41,416
Nitatoa fomu ya maombi, pasipoti, na kadi ya sasa ya kukaa nchini.

881
00:52:41,439 --> 00:52:44,906
Tafadhali toa picha moja ya uso pia.

882
00:52:44,929 --> 00:52:47,262
Nimeandaa picha.

883
00:52:47,285 --> 00:52:50,019
Nimeandika jina langu nyuma ya picha.

884
00:52:50,042 --> 00:52:54,678
Picha yenye urefu wa sentimita nne na upana wa sentimita tatu, ndiyo hiyo.

885
00:52:54,701 --> 00:52:56,668
Nimeshakuthibitisha.

886
00:52:56,691 --> 00:52:59,533
Je, kuna hitilafu yoyote kwenye hati?

887
00:52:59,557 --> 00:53:00,990
Ndiyo.

888
00:53:01,013 --> 00:53:04,980
Umeandika vizuri sana, hakuna tatizo.

889
00:53:05,003 --> 00:53:09,502
Je, naweza kupokea kadi mpya ya kukaa nchini leo?

890
00:53:09,525 --> 00:53:14,198
Kuna ukaguzi, hivyo utatumiwa barua pepe baadaye.

891
00:53:14,221 --> 00:53:18,588
Nitarudi baada ya kupokea barua pepe nyumbani.

892
00:53:18,611 --> 00:53:19,744
Ndiyo.

893
00:53:19,768 --> 00:53:23,101
Tafadhali leta barua pepe na pasipoti yako.

894
00:53:23,124 --> 00:53:26,091
Gharama ni kiasi gani?

895
00:53:26,114 --> 00:53:31,009
Gharama ni stempu ya mapato ya yenye thamani ya elfu nne.

896
00:53:31,032 --> 00:53:34,052
Stempu ya mapato ninunua wapi?

897
00:53:34,075 --> 00:53:37,716
Unaweza kununua stempu hiyo kwenye duka la bidhaa la ghorofa ya kwanza.

898
00:53:37,740 --> 00:53:41,540
Je, kuna kitu chochote kinachoonyesha kuwa nimefanya mchakato wa leo?

899
00:53:41,563 --> 00:53:47,249
Nitapiga muhuri wa maombi ya kusasisha nyuma ya kadi yako ya kukaa nchini.

900
00:53:47,273 --> 00:53:51,473
Je, ikiwa kuna muhuri, muda wa kadi utasogezwa?

901
00:53:51,496 --> 00:53:52,929
Ndiyo.

902
00:53:52,952 --> 00:53:57,285
Muda wa kadi utasogezwa kwa miezi miwili hadi matokeo yatoke.

903
00:53:57,308 --> 00:54:00,722
Hiyo inanipa amani ya akili.

904
00:54:00,746 --> 00:54:04,813
Nitakupatia nakala ya tiketi ya kupokelewa kwa maombi.

905
00:54:04,836 --> 00:54:07,803
Nitahifadhi nakala hii vizuri.

906
00:54:07,826 --> 00:54:12,992
Barua pepe ya taarifa kwa kawaida hufika katika kipindi cha wiki mbili hadi tatu.

907
00:54:13,015 --> 00:54:16,549
Nitazingatia sanduku la barua kila siku.

908
00:54:16,572 --> 00:54:20,638
Ikiwa anwani yako itabadilika, tafadhali tujulishe mara moja.

909
00:54:20,661 --> 00:54:22,109
Nimeelewa.

910
00:54:22,133 --> 00:54:24,466
Anwani yangu haijabadilika.

911
00:54:24,489 --> 00:54:28,489
Mchakato wa kupokelewa kwa leo umekamilika.

912
00:54:28,512 --> 00:54:32,046
Asante kwa kunisaidia kwa ufanisi.

913
00:54:32,069 --> 00:54:33,635
Asante sana.

914
00:54:33,658 --> 00:54:36,658
Endelea na tahadhari.

915
00:54:36,681 --> 00:54:38,181
Sehemu ya 18: Misingi ya Mchakato wa Kuhamia / Mchakato wa Msingi wa Kuhamia

916
00:54:38,181 --> 00:54:42,981
Samahani. Ningependa kufanya mchakato wa kuhamia.

917
00:54:43,004 --> 00:54:45,373
Karibu sana.

918
00:54:45,397 --> 00:54:48,730
Tafadhali nendeni kwenye dirisha la jumla la wageni.

919
00:54:48,753 --> 00:54:52,353
Nimehamia mji mpya.

920
00:54:52,376 --> 00:54:55,949
Tutafanya mchakato wa taarifa ya kuhamia.

921
00:54:55,973 --> 00:54:59,806
Ni lazima nikubaliye karatasi zipi?

922
00:54:59,829 --> 00:55:05,605
Tafadhali andika anwani yako mpya kwenye fomu hii ya kuhamia.

923
00:55:05,629 --> 00:55:08,196
Je, utaandika kwa herufi za Kichina (Kanji)?

924
00:55:08,219 --> 00:55:10,452
Au kwa herufi za Kirumi (Romaji)?

925
00:55:10,475 --> 00:55:15,342
Tafadhali andika anwani yako kwa herufi za Kichina au kwa jina la sauti (furigana).

926
00:55:15,365 --> 00:55:19,365
Na pia andika namba ya chumba cha ghorofa yako.

927
00:55:19,388 --> 00:55:23,988
Ndiyo, tafadhali hakikisha unaandika namba ya chumba kwa usahihi.

928
00:55:24,011 --> 00:55:26,977
Je, tarehe ya kuhamia ni ipi?

929
00:55:27,000 --> 00:55:28,934
kama inavyosemwa hapa.

930
00:55:28,957 --> 00:55:34,523
Tafadhali andika tarehe halisi uliyohamia nyumbani mpya.

931
00:55:34,546 --> 00:55:37,546
Nimeandika tarehe 20 Julai.

932
00:55:37,569 --> 00:55:42,707
Je, una cheti cha kuondoka kutoka ofisi ya blabu ya zamani?

933
00:55:42,731 --> 00:55:48,767
Ndiyo, nina cheti cha kuondoka na kadi ya kukaa.

934
00:55:48,790 --> 00:55:50,557
Asante sana.

935
00:55:50,580 --> 00:55:53,946
Tutakubali karatasi zako.

936
00:55:53,969 --> 00:55:58,772
Je, nitaandikia anwani mpya nyuma ya kadi yako ya kukaa?

937
00:55:58,796 --> 00:56:03,529
Ndiyo, tutaandika anwani mpya nyuma ya kadi.

938
00:56:03,552 --> 00:56:07,927
Je, pia ninahitaji kubadilisha anwani kwenye kadi yangu ya My Number?

939
00:56:07,951 --> 00:56:13,751
Ndiyo, tutabadilisha anwani kwenye kadi yako ya My Number pia.

940
00:56:13,774 --> 00:56:18,574
Je, nitaingiza nambari ya siri ya kadi yangu ya My Number?

941
00:56:18,597 --> 00:56:25,564
Ndiyo, tafadhali ingiza nambari ya siri yenye tarakimu nne kwenye kifaa hiki.

942
00:56:25,587 --> 00:56:28,486
Nimeingiza nambari ya siri.

943
00:56:28,509 --> 00:56:32,076
Tumekuuza data ya kadi yako.

944
00:56:32,099 --> 00:56:36,232
Je, naweza kupata nakala ya hati ya wakazi?

945
00:56:36,255 --> 00:56:42,073
Ndiyo, tunaweza kukutoa nakala ya hati ya wakazi kwa anwani yako mpya.

946
00:56:42,096 --> 00:56:46,063
Nakala moja inagharimu pesa ngapi?

947
00:56:46,086 --> 00:56:51,053
Nakala ya hati ya wakazi inagharimu shilingi 300 kwa moja.

948
00:56:51,076 --> 00:56:55,310
Nitazituma kwa kampuni yangu, basi nipatie mbili.

949
00:56:55,333 --> 00:56:58,799
Mbili zitagharimu shilingi 600.

950
00:56:58,822 --> 00:57:00,920
Nitakulipa kwa pesa taslimu.

951
00:57:00,944 --> 00:57:03,353
Nitakulipa shilingi 600.

952
00:57:03,377 --> 00:57:06,344
Tunapokea shilingi 600 kamili.

953
00:57:06,367 --> 00:57:09,533
Tutakupatia nakala mbili za hati ya wakazi.

954
00:57:09,556 --> 00:57:13,094
Asante kwa kushughulikia haraka.

955
00:57:13,118 --> 00:57:17,251
Tutakupatia pia broshua kuhusu jinsi ya kutupa taka.

956
00:57:17,274 --> 00:57:21,120
Je, naweza kupata broshua kwa Kiingereza?

957
00:57:21,144 --> 00:57:25,181
Ndiyo, tafadhali, hii ni mwongozo wa kutenganisha taka kwa Kiingereza.

958
00:57:25,205 --> 00:57:29,971
Nitakutupa taka kulingana na siku za wiki.

959
00:57:29,994 --> 00:57:34,594
Siku za kukusanya taka zinatofautiana kulingana na eneo, tafadhali hakikisha.

960
00:57:34,617 --> 00:57:38,284
Asante kwa maelezo ya kina.

961
00:57:38,307 --> 00:57:42,474
Furahia maisha yako katika mji mpya!

962
00:57:42,497 --> 00:57:43,997
Sehemu ya 19: Utaratibu wa Kupokea Kadi ya My Number

963
00:57:43,997 --> 00:57:45,930
Samahani.

964
00:57:45,953 --> 00:57:49,486
Ningependa kupokea kadi yangu ya My Number.

965
00:57:49,509 --> 00:57:51,509
Karibu sana.

966
00:57:51,533 --> 00:57:54,099
Tafadhali nenda kwenye dirisha la ugawaji.

967
00:57:54,122 --> 00:57:59,726
Barua ya kipink ya arifa ya ugawaji imefika nyumbani kwangu.

968
00:57:59,750 --> 00:58:02,753
Tutakubali barua hiyo.

969
00:58:02,776 --> 00:58:05,474
Je, una nyaraka za kutambua mtu?

970
00:58:05,498 --> 00:58:09,564
Nina kadi ya kukaa na pasipoti.

971
00:58:09,587 --> 00:58:11,521
Tutazihakiki.

972
00:58:11,544 --> 00:58:13,910
Uthibitisho umekamilika.

973
00:58:13,933 --> 00:58:19,067
Nimeandika jina na anwani yangu nyuma ya barua hiyo.

974
00:58:19,090 --> 00:58:22,890
Sahihi pia imeingizwa.

975
00:58:22,913 --> 00:58:24,382
Asante sana.

976
00:58:24,405 --> 00:58:28,654
Je, unahitaji kuweka nambari ya siri?

977
00:58:28,677 --> 00:58:32,844
Tafadhali weka nambari ya siri kwenye kifaa chako.

978
00:58:32,867 --> 00:58:36,757
Unataka kuweka aina ngapi za nambari za siri?

979
00:58:36,781 --> 00:58:42,448
Tutakuwa tunazingatia nambari ya siri ya tarakimu nne na nywila ya alama na herufi.

980
00:58:42,471 --> 00:58:48,104
Nambari ya tarakimu nne itatumika kwa kutolea cheti katika maduka ya konbini?

981
00:58:48,127 --> 00:58:49,461
Ndiyo.

982
00:58:49,484 --> 00:58:53,550
Nitaitumia wakati wa kuchapisha kumbukumbu ya wakazi katika konbini.

983
00:58:53,573 --> 00:59:00,540
Ingiza nambari ya tarakimu nne kwenye kiwambo cha nambari. Tafadhali tumia baobonye la skrini.

984
00:59:00,563 --> 00:59:02,296
Nimeingiza.

985
00:59:02,319 --> 00:59:05,953
Sasa ni wakati wa nywila yenye alama na herufi.

986
00:59:05,976 --> 00:59:11,542
Tafadhali ingiza nywila yenye alama na herufi isiyopungua ya tarakimu sita na isiyozidi kumi na sita.

987
00:59:11,565 --> 00:59:14,998
Nimeingiza mchanganyiko wa herufi kubwa na ndogo.

988
00:59:15,021 --> 00:59:18,690
Umefanikiwa kuweka nambari ya siri.

989
00:59:18,714 --> 00:59:24,148
Tafadhali andika nambari ya siri kwenye karatasi hii ili uihifadhi.

990
00:59:24,170 --> 00:59:25,404
Ndiyo.

991
00:59:25,427 --> 00:59:28,673
Hifadhi kwa makini ili usisahau.

992
00:59:28,697 --> 00:59:33,430
Kadi ya My Number itakuwa na muda wa kutumika mpaka lini?

993
00:59:33,453 --> 00:59:38,120
Itakuwa hadi tarehe ileile na kadi ya kukaa kwako.

994
00:59:38,143 --> 00:59:41,920
Baada ya kusasisha kadi ya kukaa, nifanye nini?

995
00:59:41,944 --> 00:59:47,144
Baada ya kusasisha kadi ya kukaa, muda wa matumizi wa kadi pia utasasishwa.

996
00:59:47,167 --> 00:59:51,500
Je, nitahitaji kuja ofisini ya manispaa wakati huo?

997
00:59:51,523 --> 00:59:53,004
Ndiyo.

998
00:59:53,028 --> 00:59:57,261
Tafadhali njoo ofisini ya manispaa kabla ya muda wa matumizi kuisha.

999
00:59:57,284 --> 01:00:00,972
Je, tutaangalia picha ya kadi na uso wako?

1000
01:00:00,996 --> 01:00:02,638
Ndiyo.

1001
01:00:02,661 --> 01:00:06,479
Tutakuthibitisha uso wako kwa kamera ya skrini.

1002
01:00:06,503 --> 01:00:09,586
Ondoa barakoa na uangalie skrini.

1003
01:00:09,609 --> 01:00:12,209
Uthibitisho wa kitambulisho umekamilika.

1004
01:00:12,232 --> 01:00:14,604
Tutakupatia kadi yako.

1005
01:00:14,628 --> 01:00:19,228
Mwishowe, nimepata kadi ya My Number!

1006
01:00:19,251 --> 01:00:22,860
Unaweza kutumia kama kadi ya bima ya afya pia.

1007
01:00:22,883 --> 01:00:27,134
Ni rahisi sana wakati wa kwenda hospitalini.

1008
01:00:27,158 --> 01:00:30,958
Tafadhali weka programu ya 'My Na Portal' kwenye simu yako na utumie.

1009
01:00:30,981 --> 01:00:34,981
Nitapakua na kutumia programu ya simu pia.

1010
01:00:35,004 --> 01:00:39,216
Ikiwa utapoteza kadi, tafadhali piga simu mara moja.

1011
01:00:39,239 --> 01:00:42,498
Nitaiweka kwa makini kwenye pochi yangu.

1012
01:00:42,522 --> 01:00:45,689
Asante kwa kuja leo.

1013
01:00:45,712 --> 01:00:47,212
Sehemu ya 20: Utangulizi wa Madarasa ya Kijapani

1014
01:00:47,212 --> 01:00:48,818
Samahani.

1015
01:00:48,841 --> 01:00:52,819
Tafadhali nielezee kuhusu madarasa ya Kijapani.

1016
01:00:52,842 --> 01:00:54,812
Karibu sana.

1017
01:00:54,835 --> 01:00:58,314
Ni madarasa ya Kijapani ya kujitolea.

1018
01:00:58,338 --> 01:01:02,371
Je, naweza kujifunza Kijapani hapa?

1019
01:01:02,394 --> 01:01:03,853
Ndiyo,

1020
01:01:03,877 --> 01:01:08,890
Hufanyika kila Jumamosi katika kituo cha jamii.

1021
01:01:08,913 --> 01:01:12,485
Darsa huanza saa ngapi na huishia saa ngapi?

1022
01:01:12,508 --> 01:01:18,542
Ni saa tisa asubuhi hadi saa kumi na nusu mchana, kwa muda wa saa moja na nusu.

1023
01:01:18,566 --> 01:01:21,799
Je, ada au malipo ya darsa ni kiasi gani?

1024
01:01:21,822 --> 01:01:25,198
Darsa ni bure.

1025
01:01:25,222 --> 01:01:26,822
Bure?

1026
01:01:26,845 --> 01:01:29,478
Nafurahi sana kusikia hivyo.

1027
01:01:29,501 --> 01:01:33,901
Gharama ya kitabu ni shilingi mia tano tu, kwa gharama halisi.

1028
01:01:33,924 --> 01:01:36,924
Shilingi mia tano ni bei rahisi.

1029
01:01:36,947 --> 01:01:40,114
Je, mnatumia vitabu vya aina gani?

1030
01:01:40,137 --> 01:01:45,737
Tunatumia kitabu cha kiwango cha N5 kinachofaa kwa wanaoanza.

1031
01:01:45,760 --> 01:01:50,129
Je, naweza kujifunza kutoka hiragana na katakana?

1032
01:01:50,153 --> 01:01:51,434
Ndiyo,

1033
01:01:51,457 --> 01:01:56,136
Tutakufundisha kwa utaratibu jinsi ya kusoma na kuandika hiragana.

1034
01:01:56,160 --> 01:01:59,560
Je, mwalimu ni mfanyakazi wa kujitolea?

1035
01:01:59,583 --> 01:02:04,116
Mwalimu mzuri wa kujitolea kutoka jamii atakuwa anafundisha.

1036
01:02:04,139 --> 01:02:07,739
Je, naweza kupata mafunzo ya mtu kwa mtu?

1037
01:02:07,762 --> 01:02:12,540
Kwa wanafunzi wawili, kuna mwalimu mmoja.

1038
01:02:12,563 --> 01:02:16,130
Ni mazingira mazuri ambapo unaweza kuuliza maswali mengi.

1039
01:02:16,153 --> 01:02:20,386
Unaweza kufanya mazoezi mengi ya mazungumzo.

1040
01:02:20,409 --> 01:02:24,018
Je, naweza kuleta watoto wangu?

1041
01:02:24,042 --> 01:02:25,412
Ndiyo,

1042
01:02:25,436 --> 01:02:30,436
Watoto wanaweza kucheza katika eneo la watoto kando.

1043
01:02:30,459 --> 01:02:35,038
Unaweza kuja kwa usalama pamoja na watoto wako.

1044
01:02:35,061 --> 01:02:38,094
Kuna wafanyakazi wa kujitolea wa kutunza watoto pia.

1045
01:02:38,118 --> 01:02:40,995
Hiyo inasaidia sana.

1046
01:02:41,018 --> 01:02:45,290
Unaweza kutembelea kwa uchunguzi asubuhi ya Jumamosi.

1047
01:02:45,314 --> 01:02:49,047
Ningependa kutembelea kwa uchunguzi Jumamosi hii.

1048
01:02:49,070 --> 01:02:50,270
Ndiyo,

1049
01:02:50,293 --> 01:02:53,735
Unaweza kutembelea kwa uhuru.

1050
01:02:53,759 --> 01:02:57,992
Nitakuja Jumamosi hii asubuhi saa nne.

1051
01:02:58,015 --> 01:03:03,349
Tafadhali njoo kwenye dirisha la ukaguzi hapa saa kumi na robo mchana.

1052
01:03:03,372 --> 01:03:07,940
Je, ninahitaji kujaza fomu sasa?

1053
01:03:07,963 --> 01:03:12,896
Tafadhali jaza jina lako na anwani leo.

1054
01:03:12,919 --> 01:03:16,523
Nitaandika jina na nambari ya simu kwenye karatasi.

1055
01:03:16,547 --> 01:03:18,846
Asante kwa kujaza.

1056
01:03:18,869 --> 01:03:21,477
Umeandikishwa.

1057
01:03:21,501 --> 01:03:25,194
Ninangojelea kwa hamu kwenda darasani Jumamosi.

1058
01:03:25,218 --> 01:03:29,651
Tujifunze Kijapani kwa furaha pamoja na marafiki.

1059
01:03:29,674 --> 01:03:33,074
Nitawaleta marafiki wangu pia.

1060
01:03:33,097 --> 01:03:36,864
Tafadhaliwalete marafiki wako pia.

1061
01:03:36,887 --> 01:03:40,854
Asante kwa kuniongoza kwa wema.

1062
01:03:40,878 --> 01:03:43,411
Tunakupongeza.

1063
01:03:43,434 --> 01:03:45,802
Endelea na tahadhari.